   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, [3,1,0] x [3,1,0]: point A (k = 2) through the untwist pipeline (2026-10-10)\n\nImplements `L2-310-untwist-CG-spec.md`: the [3,1,0] version of `L2-210-untwist-CG.wb`. Plain GT generators JJ, new conventions, diagonal frame, exact sparse transfer matrices, 200 digits. **Execution note.** VS Code did not execute cells of this new file; every cell's source was run in the shared kernel K1 (via `Get` of the cell source) and the printed result is stored in the markdown cell below the code. Re-run in VS Code to store native outputs. The first code cell clears the shared kernel.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
