   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"time (s): all 7 minor families + one twist\", 1.0228268}\n{\"qdet dev\", ScientificForm[5.795472464704524*^-200, 3]}\n{\"[t1,t2] dev\", ScientificForm[1.391346577654331*^-193, 3]}\n{\"degree check\", ScientificForm[0, 3], \"(exact zeros: accuracy bound if tracked)\"}\n{\"Precision of t-coeffs\", 197.2389882168412}\n```",
