   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"expN = MatrixExp on root generators (exact, 3 test values)\", True}\n{\"x0Of (factorized inverse) = x0 from Inverse[Pph1] (exact, z = (3/2,5/4,2/3))\", True}\n{\"y0 = -27/8, t12 = 62/35\", True}\n{\"v2 = e1^T rho(n_A) exactly (oneSiteVac vs Gauss element, regime point eps=10^-6)\", True}\n{\"dressing in the regime: beta(eps=1e-6)/beta0 - 1, gamma(1e-6)/gamma(2e-6) (expect ~ 1/2)\", \n {8.5714310204088629739608497031`5.*^-8, 0.5000002592206883287`8.}}\n```",
