  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* exact HW kets of V(x)V (common null space of the total raising ops per total-weight sector), weights, G-orthogonal projectors per HW sector. G2 = G(x)G is the invariant inner product (JJ is not Hermitian), so P_HW = H (H^T G2 H)^-1 H^T G2 is the projector that is orthogonal in the Hermitian EH frame. site-1 weight classes u12wts/u12idx (GT indices per weight) for the per-weight analyses. *)\nu12raiseM = Join[E1[1, 2] + E2[1, 2], E1[1, 3] + E2[1, 3], E1[2, 3] + E2[2, 3]];\nhwSecs = {{6, 2, 0}, {6, 1, 1}, {5, 3, 0}, {5, 2, 1}, {4, 4, 0}, {4, 3, 1}, {4, 2, 2}, {3, 3, 2}};\nhwKets[mu_] := hwKets[mu] = With[{sec = secOf[mu]}, Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> v], {d2}]], {v, NullSpace[Normal[u12raiseM[[All, sec]]]]}]];\nu12HW = Flatten[hwKets /@ hwSecs, 1];\nu12e12 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[u12e1, u12e1]];\ngd2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Diagonal[gMet], Diagonal[gMet]]];\nhwH[mu_] := hwH[mu] = Transpose[hwKets[mu]];\nhwMinv[mu_] := hwMinv[mu] = Inverse[Transpose[hwH[mu]] . (gd2 hwH[mu])];\nPHWc[mu_][psi_] := hwH[mu] . (hwMinv[mu] . (Transpose[hwH[mu]] . (gd2 psi)));\ngNorm[psi_] := Sqrt[Total[gd2 psi^2]];\n(* site-1 weight classes *)\nu12wt1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nu12wts = Union[u12wt1]; u12idx = Table[Flatten[Position[u12wt1, m]], {m, u12wts}]; u12dims = Length /@ u12idx;\nidxOf[wt_] := u12idx[[Position[u12wts, wt][[1, 1]]]];\n(* the 10 HW branches: {mu, copy}; the site-1 weight carrying the CG slice is nu = mu - Lambda *)\nhwList = Flatten[Table[Table[{mu, c}, {c, Length[hwKets[mu]]}], {mu, hwSecs}], 1];\nchecks[\"HW number of kets = 10\"] = Length[u12HW];\nchecks[\"HW kets annihilated by all total raising ops\"] = And @@ (Normal[u12raiseM . #] === ConstantArray[0, 3 d2] & /@ u12HW);\nchecks[\"HW multiplicities per sector\"] = Length[hwKets[#]] & /@ hwSecs;\nchecks[\"sector sizes\"] = Length[secOf[#]] & /@ hwSecs;\nchecks[\"G2-projector: idempotent, fixes HW kets, G2-orthogonal residual (exact)\"] = With[{vv = Table[(-1)^k k/7, {k, d2}]}, And @@ Table[PHWc[mu][PHWc[mu][vv]] === PHWc[mu][vv] && (And @@ (PHWc[mu][#] === # & /@ hwKets[mu])) && (And @@ (Total[gd2 # (vv - PHWc[mu][vv])] === 0 & /@ hwKets[mu])), {mu, hwSecs}]];\nchecks[\"site-1 weight dims for nu = mu - Lambda (expect 1,1,1,2,1,2,2,1)\"] = Table[Length[idxOf[mu - Λ]], {mu, hwSecs}];\n(* exactness of the undo at regime points: <v1(x)v2|HW> = s <phi(x)e1|HW> with s = (v2)_1 = 1 and (rho(n)(x)rho(n)).HW = HW *)\nchecks[\"undo exact for the 10 HW kets (3 regime points) and (rho(n)(x)rho(n)).HW = HW\"] = Table[With[{R = reg[10^-6, phiP, o[[1]], o[[2]]]}, With[{zz = R[\"z\"], w1 = R[\"w1\"], w2 = R[\"w2\"], y = R[\"y\"]}, With[{v1 = vA1[zz, w1, w2], v2 = vA2[zz, w1, w2], ph = phiA[zz, w1, w2], Rn = u12rN[zz, w1, y]}, {And @@ (Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]] . # === v2[[1]] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[ph, u12e1]] . # & /@ u12HW), And @@ (KroneckerProduct[Rn, Rn] . # === # & /@ u12HW), v2[[1]]}]]], {o, {{3/4, -1/5}, {-5/3, 9/7}, {7/2, -7/4}}}];\nGrid[Join[List @@@ Normal[checks][[-6 ;;]]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"HW kets annihilated by all total raising ops\", True}\n{\"HW multiplicities per sector\", {1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1}}\n{\"sector sizes\", {1, 2, 2, 6, 3, 10, 14, 18}}\n{\"G2-projector: idempotent, fixes HW kets, G2-orthogonal residual (exact)\", True}\n{\"site-1 weight dims for nu = mu - Lambda (expect 1,1,1,2,1,2,2,1)\", {1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1}}\n{\"undo exact for the 10 HW kets (3 regime points) and (rho(n)(x)rho(n)).HW = HW\", {{True, True, 1}, {True, True, 1}, {True, True, 1}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
