  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Q machinery. A state is an association st = <|\"qu\" -> {q1,q2,q3} (monic dual polynomials in X, degrees mu_j), \"z\" -> ket twist|>; Q^j(x) = z_j^(x/h) q^j(x). Vacuum direct Q_i^vac(x) = w_i^(-x/h) q_i^vac(x), degrees (0,4,6), given as the function F[i, x]. Nothing is read from globals other than the rep data (Lambda, h, theta). *)\npoles = Flatten[Table[{s, n}, {s, nL}, {n, Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]}], 1];\nxP[{s_, n_}] := thN[[s]] - n hN;\nwgt[p_] := wgt[p] = 1/Product[xP[p] - xP[q], {q, DeleteCases[poles, p]}];\nins[1][x_] := 1; ins[2][x_] := Exp[2 Pi I x/hN];\nprsL1 = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nQUf[st_, j_, x_] := st[\"z\"][[j]]^(x/hN) (st[\"qu\"][[j]] /. X -> x);\nrowG[st_, F_, {i_, j_}, k_] := Sum[N[wgt[p] ins[k][xP[p]], pr] With[{x = xP[p]}, {-QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x], -x QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x], QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x + hN], x QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x + hN], QUf[st, j, x - hN] F[i, x], x QUf[st, j, x - hN] F[i, x]}], {p, poles}];\ndet6[st_, F_] := Det[Flatten[Table[rowG[st, F, ij, k], {k, 2}, {ij, prsL1}], 1]];\n(* reference factor Psi_Q(x0) with the vacuum SoV triple (theta - 4h, theta - 3h, theta - h) (Undo-site2-rotation-notes 6: [3,1,0] row) *)\npsiQ[st_] := Product[With[{t = thN[[s]]}, (QUf[st, 2, t - 3 hN] QUf[st, 3, t - 4 hN] - QUf[st, 3, t - 3 hN] QUf[st, 2, t - 4 hN]) QUf[st, 3, t - hN]], {s, nL}];\n(* ladder-1 (site 1 only) brackets over a pole set P, one-site weights w_n = 1/prod_{m in P\\n}(m-n)h *)\nth1 = thN[[1]];\nwgtP[P_, n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[P, n]}];\nbrP[P_, f_] := Sum[wgtP[P, n] f[th1 - n hN], {n, P}];\n(* det2^(P)[y] = det_{j in {3,2}} [-<Q^j E>_P, <Q^j[-] E>_P], E(x) = y^(-(x-th1)/h), Q^j[-](x) = Q^j(x-h) *)\ndet2P[st_, y_, P_] := Module[{Ex = Function[x, N[y^(-(x - th1)/hN), pr]]}, Det[Table[{-brP[P, Function[x, QUf[st, j, x] Ex[x]]], brP[P, Function[x, QUf[st, j, x - hN] Ex[x]]]}, {j, {3, 2}}]]];\n(* W(a,b) = Q2(th1 - a h) Q3(th1 - b h) - Q3(th1 - a h) Q2(th1 - b h); minor1 = W(3,4) *)\nWab[st_, a_, b_] := QUf[st, 2, th1 - a hN] QUf[st, 3, th1 - b hN] - QUf[st, 3, th1 - a hN] QUf[st, 2, th1 - b hN];\nminor1[st_] := Wab[st, 3, 4];\nPset = {0, 1, 2};\nmakeFvac[ww_, qv_] := Function[{i, x}, ww[[i]]^(-x/hN) (qv[[i]] /. X -> x)];\n(* fixed-degree monic Baxter solver (overdetermined least squares, no Chop), verbatim from L2-diagonal-frame-overlap-EH.wb cell 95 *)\nauditVac[zz_, hh_, ths_] := Table[Sum[Times @@ Table[zz[[ii[[k]]]] auditNu[hh, ths, ii[[k]], u - (k - 1) hh], {k, a}], {ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}], {a, 3}];\nauditQdet[zz_, hh_, ths_, x_] := (Times @@ zz) auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x] auditNu[hh, ths, 2, x - hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh];\nauditOp[tt_, q_, zz_, sgn_, hh_, ths_, x_] := If[sgn == 1,\n  auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh] zz (q /. X -> x + hh)\n  - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh] (q /. X -> x)\n  + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x) auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh] (q /. X -> x - hh)/zz\n  - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x) (q /. X -> x - 2 hh)/zz^2,\n  auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x] auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + 2 hh] zz (q /. X -> x - hh)\n  - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + 2 hh] (q /. X -> x)\n  + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hh) auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + 2 hh] (q /. X -> x + hh)/zz\n  - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hh) (q /. X -> x + 2 hh)/zz^2];\nauditMonicQ[tt_, zz_, sgn_, deg_, hh_, ths_, prc_] := Module[{vars, eq, ar, sol},\n  If[deg == 0, Return[1]]; vars = Array[aq, deg]; eq = CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt, X^deg + Sum[vars[[k + 1]] X^k, {k, 0, deg - 1}], zz, sgn, hh, ths, X]], X];\n  ar = CoefficientArrays[eq, vars]; sol = LeastSquares[N[Normal[ar[[2]]], prc], -N[Normal[ar[[1]]], prc]];\n  Expand[X^deg + Sum[sol[[k + 1]] X^k, {k, 0, deg - 1}]]];\n(* Baxter residual in exact arithmetic on the stored numbers (the naive norm of tracked approximate zeros prints an exact 0 with Precision Infinity, Clean-CG-combinations trap) *)\nbaxRes[tt_, qq_, zz_, sgn_] := Module[{t1 = SetPrecision[tt, Infinity], q1 = SetPrecision[qq, Infinity], z1 = SetPrecision[zz, Infinity]}, N[Max[Table[Norm[CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[t1, q1[[j]], z1[[j]], sgn, hN, thN, X]], X]]/Max[1, Norm[CoefficientList[q1[[j]], X]]], {j, 3}]], 6]];\n(* vacuum direct Q's of a bra twist ww: eigenvalues auditVac, degrees 0,4,6 *)\nvacDeg = {0, 4, 6};\nvacQs[ww_] := Module[{wn = N[ww, pr], tt, qv}, tt = auditVac[wn, hN, thN]; qv = Table[auditMonicQ[tt, wn[[j]], -1, vacDeg[[j]], hN, thN, pr], {j, 3}]; <|\"tt\" -> tt, \"q\" -> qv, \"F\" -> makeFvac[wn, qv], \"res\" -> baxRes[tt, qv, wn, -1], \"w\" -> wn|>];\n{tVac, vq0} = AbsoluteTiming[vacQs[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}]];\nchecks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,4,6), Baxter residual (exact arithmetic)\"] = {Exponent[vq0[\"q\"], X], vq0[\"res\"]};\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tVac}, {\"degrees\", ToString[checks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,4,6), Baxter residual (exact arithmetic)\"][[1]]]}, {\"Baxter residual\", ScientificForm[checks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,4,6), Baxter residual (exact arithmetic)\"][[2]], 3]}, {\"Precision of the coefficients of q_3\", Precision[vq0[\"q\"][[3]]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"time (s)\", 0.0482769}\n{\"degrees\", \"{0, 4, 6}\"}\n{\"Baxter residual\", ScientificForm[5.26667402171095796`6.*^-195, 3]}\n{\"Precision of the coefficients of q_3\", 196.736628389568}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
