  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Finite-twist regression (spec 1.4), before any small-eps work",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* FINITE-TWIST REGRESSION (spec 1.4), before any small-eps work. At z = (3/2,5/4,2/3), w = (5/2,7/3,3/5) (w2 = 7/3, y_A = -63/8): rebuild v1, v2 from the closed forms and check (i) <v1(x)v2|HW> = s <phi_A(x)e1|HW> exactly on the 10 HW kets; (ii) the det identity <v1(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = const x det6[Q_B, Q_vac(w)]/Psi_Q x det2^(0,1,2)[Q_B; y_A]/W(3,4) over ALL 225 states (all 36 weight sectors, 200 digits). One state is timed first. *)\nzR = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wR = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5};\nchecks[\"REG y_A = -63/8\"] = yAOf[wR[[2]]];\nv1R = vA1[zR, wR[[1]], wR[[2]]]; v2R = vA2[zR, wR[[1]], wR[[2]]]; phR = phiA[zR, wR[[1]], wR[[2]]];\nchecks[\"REG (i) <v1(x)v2|HW> = s <phi_A(x)e1|HW>, 10 HW kets (exact), s = (v2)_1\"] = {And @@ (Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1R, v2R]] . # === v2R[[1]] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[phR, u12e1]] . # & /@ u12HW), v2R[[1]]};\nchecks[\"REG K12 = beta(w2-z1)/w2 = 2/25\"] = dressBeta[zR, wR[[1]], wR[[2]]] (wR[[2]] - zR[[1]])/wR[[2]];\nchecks[\"REG K13 = gamma (w2-z1)(yA-z3)/w2^2 (the notes quote 189/704; sign to be seen)\"] = dressGamma[zR, wR[[1]], wR[[2]]] (wR[[2]] - zR[[1]]) (yAOf[wR[[2]]] - zR[[3]])/wR[[2]]^2;\n{tSt1, st1} = AbsoluteTiming[statesCore[zR, {6, 2, 0}]];\nvqR = vacQs[wR];\nv12R = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1R, v2R]], pr];\nrQof[st_, vq_, y_] := det6[st, vq[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st] det2P[st, N[y, pr], Pset]/minor1[st];\n{tOne, rQone} = AbsoluteTiming[rQof[st1[[1]][\"st\"], vqR, yAOf[wR[[2]]]]];\n{tAll, allSt} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[statesCore[zR, #] & /@ Union[wtBasis], 1]];\n{tRq, rqAll} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[rQof[s[\"st\"], vqR, yAOf[wR[[2]]]], {s, allSt}]];\novlAll = Table[v12R . s[\"psi\"], {s, allSt}];\nratioAll = ovlAll/rqAll;\nconstDev[l_List] := Max[Abs[l/l[[1]] - 1]];\nchecks[\"REG (ii) # states, max exact Baxter residual (dual Q's), vacuum Q degrees, vacuum Baxter residual\"] = {Length[allSt], Max[allSt[[All, \"bax\"]]], Exponent[vqR[\"q\"], X], vqR[\"res\"]};\nchecks[\"REG (ii) <v1(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> / (det6/Psi_Q x det2/W(3,4)): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1| over 225 states\"] = sz[constDev[ratioAll]];\nchecks[\"REG (ii) the constant ratio[1] and Precision\"] = {N[ratioAll[[1]], 15], Precision[ratioAll[[1]]]};\n(* controls: a wrong y and the point-B pole set {0..3} must fail *)\nchecks[\"REG controls (y = 2, 3 ; pole set {0..3} at y_A): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\"] = Table[N[constDev[ovlAll/Table[det6[s[\"st\"], vqR[\"F\"]]/psiQ[s[\"st\"]] det2P[s[\"st\"], N[c[[1]], pr], c[[2]]]/minor1[s[\"st\"]], {s, allSt}]], 3], {c, {{2, Pset}, {3, Pset}, {yAOf[wR[[2]]], {0, 1, 2, 3}}}}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): one sector (1 state); 225 states; det6 x det2 for 225 states\", ToString[{tSt1, tAll, tRq}]}, {\"time (s): one R_Q\", tOne}}, List @@@ Select[Normal[checks], StringStartsQ[#[[1]], \"REG\"] &]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"time (s): one sector (1 state); 225 states; det6 x det2 for 225 states\", \"{0.0911055, 13.3908, 3.66623}\"}\n{\"time (s): one R_Q\", 0.0140836}\n{\"REG y_A = -63/8\", -63/8}\n{\"REG (i) <v1(x)v2|HW> = s <phi_A(x)e1|HW>, 10 HW kets (exact), s = (v2)_1\", {True, 1}}\n{\"REG K12 = beta(w2-z1)/w2 = 2/25\", 2/25}\n{\"REG K13 = gamma (w2-z1)(yA-z3)/w2^2 (the notes quote 189/704; sign to be seen)\", -189/704}\n{\"REG (ii) # states, max exact Baxter residual (dual Q's), vacuum Q degrees, vacuum Baxter residual\", \n {225, 3.7518608904682418044404014311`6.*^-184, {0, 4, 6}, 5.26667402171095796`6.*^-195}}\n{\"REG (ii) <v1(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> / (det6/Psi_Q x det2/W(3,4)): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1| over 225 states\", 1.331015146943832*^-179}\n{\"REG (ii) the constant ratio[1] and Precision\", {5.3572958694364400276267939844009`14.696285639014485*^-7 + \n   1.42744637963575341884543449239634`15.121899810487962*^-6*I, 187.31067337962804}}\n{\"REG controls (y = 2, 3 ; pole set {0..3} at y_A): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\", {10.2779813920743867435`3., 44.1081790740436984484`3., \n  44.8974464112276391434`3.}}\n```",
