  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 0. Exact eps-structure of the undone covector phi_A in the regime (z = 1+eps phi, w1 = 1+eps om1, w2 = 1+eps om2, y_A = w2 y0)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0. phi_A(eps)/delta^Lambda, delta_k = 1/(w2 - z_k), delta^Lambda = d1^3 d2, symbolic eps, everything else rational. Factorization used (exact): phi = e1 g rho(n) rho(Delta) rho(n)^-1 = (e1 g rho(Delta)) rho(n'), n' = Delta^-1 n Delta n^-1, so phi/delta^Lambda = [e1 g . diag(prod_k delta_k^(nu_k - Lambda_k))] . rho(n'); the diagonal factor is eps-free (sum_k (nu - Lambda)_k = 0), a ratio of (om2 - phi_k). Control: equality with the direct phiA/delta^Lambda at an exact eps. *)\nwtShift[nuL_, dl_] := Product[dl[[k]]^(nuL[[k]] - Λ[[k]]), {k, 3}];\ngaussFromMat[M_] := {M[[1, 2]], M[[1, 3]] - M[[1, 2]] M[[2, 3]], M[[2, 3]]};\nphiScaledS[ph_, o1_, o2_] := Module[{R = reg[epsS, ph, o1, o2], zz, w1, w2, y, dl, n, np, rv, gv, wf},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; w1 = R[\"w1\"]; w2 = R[\"w2\"]; y = R[\"y\"];\n  dl = Table[1/(w2 - zz[[k]]), {k, 3}];\n  n = u12nMat[zz, w1, y]; np = Together /@ (Inverse[DiagonalMatrix[dl]] . n . DiagonalMatrix[dl] . Inverse[n]);\n  rv = Together /@ gaussFromMat[np];\n  gv = u12e1 . dressMat[dressBeta[zz, w1, w2], dressGamma[zz, w1, w2]];\n  wf = Table[wtShift[u12wt1[[i]], dl], {i, d1}];\n  Together /@ ((gv wf) . (expN[rv[[1]] Ee[1, 2]] . expN[rv[[2]] Ee[1, 3]] . expN[rv[[3]] Ee[2, 3]]))];\nprimesOf[ph_, o1_, o2_] := Module[{R = reg[epsS, ph, o1, o2], dl, n}, dl = DiagonalMatrix[Table[1/(R[\"w2\"] - R[\"z\"][[k]]), {k, 3}]]; n = u12nMat[R[\"z\"], R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]]; Together /@ (Inverse[dl] . n . dl . Inverse[n])];\ndeltaL[R_] := 1/((R[\"w2\"] - R[\"z\"][[1]])^3 (R[\"w2\"] - R[\"z\"][[2]]));\nserC[expr_, k_] := Table[SeriesCoefficient[expr, {epsS, 0, j}], {j, 0, k}];\nleadOrd[c_] := If[AllTrue[c, # === 0 &], \"beyond\", LengthWhile[c, # === 0 &]];\n{tT0, phS} = AbsoluteTiming[phiScaledS[phiP, 3/4, -1/5]];\n{tSer, phSer} = AbsoluteTiming[serC[#, 3] & /@ phS];   (* 15 components x (eps^0..eps^3 coefficients) *)\n(* control against the direct (unfactorized) phiA at an exact eps *)\nchecks[\"T0 control: phiScaledS(eps = 1/1000) == phiA/delta^Lambda (exact, 15 components)\"] = With[{R = reg[1/1000, phiP, 3/4, -1/5]}, (phS /. epsS -> 1/1000) === phiA[R[\"z\"], R[\"w1\"], R[\"w2\"]]/deltaL[R]];\n(* per-weight table at (phi, om A): leading order of each GT index and its coefficient *)\nwtTab = Table[{u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], Table[leadOrd[phSer[[i]]], {i, u12idx[[m]]}], Table[With[{lo = leadOrd[phSer[[i]]]}, If[IntegerQ[lo], phSer[[i, lo + 1]], 0]], {i, u12idx[[m]]}]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}];\n(* the dressing constants and n' *)\nRA = reg[epsS, phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\ngamS = Together[dressGamma[RA[\"z\"], RA[\"w1\"], RA[\"w2\"]]]; betS = Together[dressBeta[RA[\"z\"], RA[\"w1\"], RA[\"w2\"]]];\nnpr = primesOf[phiP, 3/4, -1/5]; ap = npr[[1, 2]]; bp = npr[[1, 3]]; cp = npr[[2, 3]];\nap0 = (3/4 - phiP[[1]]) (phiP[[2]] - phiP[[1]])/((3/4 - phiP[[2]]) (-1/5 - phiP[[2]]));\nbeta0 = (phiP[[1]] - phiP[[2]]) (3/4 - phiP[[1]])/(2 (3/4 - phiP[[2]]) (-1/5 - phiP[[1]]));\nchecks[\"T0 (i) gamma = O(eps): gamma(eps=0), eps^1 coefficient\"] = {Limit[gamS, epsS -> 0], SeriesCoefficient[gamS, {epsS, 0, 1}]};\nchecks[\"T0 (ii) beta(0) = (phi1-phi2)(om1-phi1)/(2(om1-phi2)(om2-phi1))\"] = Limit[betS, epsS -> 0] === beta0;\nchecks[\"T0 (iii) a' exactly eps-free and = (om1-phi1)(phi2-phi1)/((om1-phi2)(om2-phi2))\"] = FreeQ[ap, epsS] && Simplify[ap - ap0] === 0;\nratS = Series[Together[bp/(ap cp)], {epsS, 0, 2}];\nchecks[\"T0 (iv) b'/(a'c') = 1 + eps (t-2)(phi2-om2): eps^0, eps^1 coeff, predicted\"] = {SeriesCoefficient[ratS, 0], SeriesCoefficient[ratS, 1], (t12 - 2) (phiP[[2]] + 1/5)};\ncp0 = Limit[cp, epsS -> 0]; bp0 = Limit[bp, epsS -> 0];\nphi0 = Limit[#, epsS -> 0] & /@ phS;\n(* closed form of phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda: dressing e1(1 + beta0 (om2-phi1)/(om2-phi2) E12) = e1 (1 - a'0/2 E12), then rho(n'_0) = exp(a'0 E12) exp(c'0 E23) *)\nbt0 = beta0 (-1/5 - phiP[[1]])/(-1/5 - phiP[[2]]);\ncand1 = u12e1 . (IdentityMatrix[d1] + bt0 Normal[Ee[1, 2]]) . expN[ap0 Ee[1, 2]] . expN[cp0 Ee[2, 3]];\ncand2 = u12e1 . expN[ap0 Ee[1, 2]] . expN[cp0 Ee[2, 3]];\ncand3 = u12e1 . (IdentityMatrix[d1] + bt0 Normal[Ee[1, 2]]) . expN[cp0 Ee[2, 3]] . expN[ap0 Ee[1, 2]];\nchecks[\"T0 (v) phi0 == e1 (1 + bt0 E12) e^{a'0 E12} e^{c'0 E23} (exact); [no-dressing variant, reversed order]\"] = {phi0 === cand1, phi0 === cand2, phi0 === cand3};\nchecks[\"T0 (vi) bt0 == -a'0/2, b'0 == a'0 c'0\"] = {bt0 === -ap0/2, bp0 === ap0 cp0};\nGrid[Join[{{\"weight\", \"dim\", \"lead order(s)\", \"lead coefficient(s)\"}}, wtTab, {{\"time (s): phiScaledS, series\", ToString[{tT0, tSer}]}}, List @@@ Select[Normal[checks], StringStartsQ[#[[1]], \"T0 (\"] || StringStartsQ[#[[1]], \"T0 control\"] &]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"weight\", \"dim\", \"lead order(s)\", \"lead coefficient(s)\"}\n{{0, 1, 3}, 1, {3}, {-1097440000/4700022327}}\n{{0, 2, 2}, 1, {2}, {-72200000/363604059}}\n{{0, 3, 1}, 1, {2}, {-2470000/12874869}}\n{{1, 0, 3}, 1, {2}, {-3978220000/969845877}}\n{{1, 1, 2}, 2, {1, 1}, {-38807500/18110547, -451250/223587}}\n{{1, 2, 1}, 2, {1, 1}, {-204250/147987, -396625/147987}}\n{{1, 3, 0}, 1, {1}, {-295750/204363}}\n{{2, 0, 2}, 1, {0}, {-26172500/3737097}}\n{{2, 1, 1}, 2, {0, 0}, {-2375/1053, -9500/1053}}\n{{2, 2, 0}, 1, {0}, {-2275/783}}\n{{3, 0, 1}, 1, {0}, {2755/3549}}\n{{3, 1, 0}, 1, {0}, {1}}\n{\"time (s): phiScaledS, series\", \"{0.0227329, 0.0057762}\"}\n{\"T0 control: phiScaledS(eps = 1/1000) == phiA/delta^Lambda (exact, 15 components)\", True}\n{\"T0 (i) gamma = O(eps): gamma(eps=0), eps^1 coefficient\", {0, -2565/56056}}\n{\"T0 (ii) beta(0) = (phi1-phi2)(om1-phi1)/(2(om1-phi2)(om2-phi1))\", True}\n{\"T0 (iii) a' exactly eps-free and = (om1-phi1)(phi2-phi1)/((om1-phi2)(om2-phi2))\", True}\n{\"T0 (iv) b'/(a'c') = 1 + eps (t-2)(phi2-om2): eps^0, eps^1 coeff, predicted\", {1, 24/1225, 24/1225}}\n{\"T0 (v) phi0 == e1 (1 + bt0 E12) e^{a'0 E12} e^{c'0 E23} (exact); [no-dressing variant, reversed order]\", {True, False, False}}\n{\"T0 (vi) bt0 == -a'0/2, b'0 == a'0 c'0\", {True, True}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* per-weight ranks over the 3x6 grid of (om1, om2), exact: rank of the eps^0, eps^1, eps^2 coefficient vectors, and cumulative ranks of (eps^0..eps^1) and (eps^0..eps^2), plus the leading orders of the components over the grid, for phi (primary) and phi' (control). A weight whose cumulative rank reaches its dimension is fully probed by the grid. *)\nrankTab[ph_] := Module[{ser18 = Table[serC[#, 2] & /@ phiScaledS[ph, o[[1]], o[[2]]], {o, omGrid}]},\n  Table[With[{ix = u12idx[[m]]}, With[{c0 = Table[s[[ix, 1]], {s, ser18}], c1 = Table[s[[ix, 2]], {s, ser18}], c2 = Table[s[[ix, 3]], {s, ser18}]}, {u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], MatrixRank[c0], MatrixRank[c1], MatrixRank[c2], MatrixRank[Join[c0, c1]], MatrixRank[Join[c0, c1, c2]], Union[Flatten[Table[leadOrd[Append[s[[i]], 1]], {s, ser18}, {i, ix}]]]}]], {m, Length[u12wts]}]];\n{tRk, rk1} = AbsoluteTiming[rankTab[phiP]];\n{tRk2, rk2} = AbsoluteTiming[rankTab[phiC]];\nchecks[\"T0 grid ranks identical for phi and phi'\"] = rk1 === rk2;\nchecks[\"T0 weights with component beyond eps^2 on the grid (lead order list contains 3 = 'beyond 2')\"] = Select[rk1, MemberQ[#[[8]], 3] &][[All, 1]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"weight\", \"dim\", \"rk eps^0\", \"rk eps^1\", \"rk eps^2\", \"rk (0..1)\", \"rk (0..2)\", \"lead orders on grid (3 = beyond eps^2)\"}}, rk1, {{\"time (s) phi, phi'\", ToString[{tRk, tRk2}], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"identical for phi, phi'\", checks[\"T0 grid ranks identical for phi and phi'\"], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"weights with a component beyond eps^2\", ToString[checks[\"T0 weights with component beyond eps^2 on the grid (lead order list contains 3 = 'beyond 2')\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
