  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Task 0 result (exact, eps symbolic).** phi_A/delta^Lambda with delta^Lambda = delta1^3 delta2; control: the factorized form equals phiA/delta^Lambda exactly at eps = 1/1000.\n\n| site-1 weight nu | dim | leading order | ranks over 3x6 grid (eps^0, eps^1, eps^2 ; cumulative 0..1, 0..2) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| (3,1,0) | 1 | eps^0 | 1,0,0 ; 1,1 |\n| (3,0,1) | 1 | eps^0 | 1,1,1 ; 1,1 |\n| (2,2,0) | 1 | eps^0 | 1,1,1 ; 1,1 |\n| (2,0,2) | 1 | eps^0 | 1,1,1 ; 1,1 |\n| (2,1,1) | 2 | eps^0 (one direction, u' = e1 E12 E23 = (2,8)) | 1,2,2 ; 2,2 (second direction at eps^1) |\n| (1,3,0) | 1 | **eps^1** | 0,1,1 ; 1,1 |\n| (1,2,1) | 2 | **eps^1** (one direction); second direction **eps^2** | 0,1,2 ; 1,2 |\n| (1,1,2) | 2 | **eps^1** (one direction); second direction **eps^2** | 0,1,2 ; 1,2 |\n| (1,0,3), (0,3,1), (0,2,2) | 1 | **eps^2** | 0,0,1 ; 0,1 |\n| (0,1,3) | 1 | beyond eps^2 (eps^3) | 0,0,0 ; 0,0 |\n\nIdentical for phi and phi'. Closed forms [exact]: gamma = O(eps) (gamma(0) = 0, eps^1 coefficient -2565/56056 at phi, om A); beta(0) = (phi1-phi2)(om1-phi1)/(2(om1-phi2)(om2-phi1)); a' = (om1-phi1)(phi2-phi1)/((om1-phi2)(om2-phi2)) exactly eps-free; b'/(a'c') = 1 + eps (t-2)(phi2-om2) + O(eps^2) (eps^1 coefficient 24/1225 = (t-2)(phi2-om2)); b'0 = a'0 c'0. **phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda = e1 (1 + (a'0/2) E12) e^{c'0 E23}**: the dressing e1(1 + beta0 (om2-phi1)/(om2-phi2) E12) = e1(1 - a'0/2 E12) times e^{a'0 E12} e^{c'0 E23}; the E12^2 term cancels exactly ((1 - a/2 E12) e^{aE12} = 1 + a/2 E12 - a^3/12 E12^3, and e1 E12^3 = 0), which is why (1,3,0) drops from eps^0 to eps^1. The no-dressing variant and the reversed order fail. **Deviations from the spec's expectation (flagged):** (1,3,0) is at eps^1, not eps^0 (one order, inside the stop rule); (1,2,1) and (1,1,2) have only one direction at eps^1; the weights (0,2,2), (1,0,3), (0,3,1) are at eps^2 (the spec allowed eps^1 or eps^2) and (0,1,3) at eps^3 (not a CG slice weight).\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 1. Chain side: signal vs contamination in the regime",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 1 machinery. R_C = <v1(x)v2|Psi_B> (<x0|Psi_B> = 1), S = <v1(x)v2|P_HW Psi_B> (G-orthogonal projector onto the HW space of the sector), K = R_C - S; exact undo check S = s <phi_A(x)e1|P_HW Psi_B> (s = (v2)_1 = 1). v1, v2, phi_A are exact rationals in eps, converted with N[., pr]. *)\nepsL = {10^-6, 2 10^-6, 4 10^-6};\nvecsAt[R_] := Module[{zz = R[\"z\"], w1 = R[\"w1\"], w2 = R[\"w2\"], v1, v2, ph},\n  v1 = vA1[zz, w1, w2]; v2 = vA2[zz, w1, w2]; ph = phiA[zz, w1, w2];\n  <|\"v12\" -> N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]], pr], \"phe1\" -> N[v2[[1]] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[ph, u12e1]], pr]|>];\nt1Point[B_, R_] := Module[{V = vecsAt[R]},\n  Table[With[{b = brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]}, Module[{psi = b[\"psi\"], Ph, RC, S, undo},\n    Ph = PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][psi]; RC = V[\"v12\"] . psi; S = V[\"v12\"] . Ph; undo = V[\"phe1\"] . Ph;\n    <|\"RC\" -> RC, \"S\" -> S, \"K\" -> RC - S, \"undoRel\" -> Abs[(S - undo)/S], \"normPsi\" -> gNorm[psi], \"hwFrac\" -> b[\"hwFrac\"], \"ev\" -> b[\"ev\"]|>]], {ib, Length[hwList]}]];\n(* time one parameter point: all 56 states of the 8 HW sectors, then the 10 branches *)\nR1 = reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\n{tBr1, B1} = AbsoluteTiming[branchesAt[R1[\"z\"]]];\n{tPt1, pt1} = AbsoluteTiming[t1Point[B1, R1]];\nchecks[\"T1 setup: 56 states, 10 HW-limit branches, top = e1(x)e1 (rel dev)\"] = {Length[B1[\"states\"]], Count[B1[\"states\"], s_ /; s[\"branch\"]], N[Norm[brOf[B1, {6, 2, 0}, 1][\"psi\"]/brOf[B1, {6, 2, 0}, 1][\"psi\"][[1]] - u12e12], 5]};\nchecks[\"T1 setup: rr separation per sector (max branch rr, min other rr)\"] = Table[With[{s = Select[B1[\"states\"], #[\"mu\"] === mu &]}, {mu, N[Max[Select[s, #[\"branch\"] &][[All, \"rr\"]]], 3], If[Length[Select[s, ! #[\"branch\"] &]] == 0, \"-\", N[Min[Select[s, ! #[\"branch\"] &][[All, \"rr\"]]], 3]]}], {mu, hwSecs}];\nchecks[\"T1 setup: max exact Baxter residual of the 56 dual Q's\"] = ScientificForm[N[Max[B1[\"states\"][[All, \"bax\"]]], 3]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): 56 states, 10 branches at one point\", ToString[{tBr1, tPt1}]}, {\"states, branches, top dev\", ToString[checks[\"T1 setup: 56 states, 10 HW-limit branches, top = e1(x)e1 (rel dev)\"]]}, {\"rr separation\", ToString[checks[\"T1 setup: rr separation per sector (max branch rr, min other rr)\"]]}, {\"max Baxter residual\", checks[\"T1 setup: max exact Baxter residual of the 56 dual Q's\"]}, {\"mu, copy\", \"|R_C|, |S|, |K|, undo rel dev, Precision(K)\"}}, Table[{hwList[[ib]], ToString[{ScientificForm[N[Abs[pt1[[ib, \"RC\"]]], 4]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[pt1[[ib, \"S\"]]], 4]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[pt1[[ib, \"K\"]]], 4]], ScientificForm[N[pt1[[ib, \"undoRel\"]], 3]], Precision[pt1[[ib, \"K\"]]]}]}, {ib, Length[hwList]}]], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"time (s): 56 states, 10 branches at one point\", \"{2.92851, 0.0252928}\"}\n{\"states, branches, top dev\", \"              -191\\n{56, 10, 0. 10    }\"}\n{\"rr separation\", \"                                       -7                            -8                            -7                            \\\n-7                            -7                            -7                            -7\\n{{{6, 2, 0}, 0, -}, {{6, 1, 1}, 2.02 10  , 1.41}, {{5, \\\n3, 0}, 5.00 10  , 2.83}, {{5, 2, 1}, 5.77 10  , 2.41}, {{4, 4, 0}, 3.90 10  , 2.00}, {{4, 3, 1}, 4.15 10  , 2.41}, {{4, 2, 2}, 9.96 10  , 2.09}, {{3, \\\n3, 2}, 6.36 10  , 1.67}}\"}\n{\"max Baxter residual\", ScientificForm[2.37645065960645`3.*^-140]}\n{\"mu, copy\", \"|R_C|, |S|, |K|, undo rel dev, Precision(K)\"}\n{{{6, 2, 0}, 1}, \"           38            38         -153         -191\\n{2.007 × 10  , 2.007 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 0. × 10    , 0.}\"}\n{{{6, 1, 1}, 1}, \"           45            45            38         -184\\n{2.786 × 10  , 2.786 × 10  , 3.057 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 177.369}\"}\n{{{5, 3, 0}, 1}, \"           45            45            37         -183\\n{8.241 × 10  , 8.241 × 10  , 6.503 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 175.535}\"}\n{{{5, 2, 1}, 1}, \"           53            53            45         -174\\n{1.149 × 10  , 1.149 × 10  , 8.921 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 167.439}\"}\n{{{5, 2, 1}, 2}, \"           52            52            45         -175\\n{2.900 × 10  , 2.900 × 10  , 4.593 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 168.558}\"}\n{{{4, 4, 0}, 1}, \"           46            46            45         -170\\n{1.787 × 10  , 1.289 × 10  , 4.973 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 169.981}\"}\n{{{4, 3, 1}, 1}, \"           53            53            53         -161\\n{3.967 × 10  , 2.813 × 10  , 1.155 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 160.757}\"}\n{{{4, 3, 1}, 2}, \"           53            53            51         -162\\n{1.092 × 10  , 1.106 × 10  , 1.470 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 159.949}\"}\n{{{4, 2, 2}, 1}, \"           59            59            59         -153\\n{7.178 × 10  , 5.254 × 10  , 1.924 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 153.07}\"}\n{{{3, 3, 2}, 1}, \"           60            59            60         -139\\n{1.660 × 10  , 3.569 × 10  , 1.303 × 10  , 0. × 10    , 140.026}\"}\n```",
