  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* full Task 1 loop: 3 eps x 18 omega x 10 branches (branches depend on eps only). eps-exponents are log2 ratios between consecutive eps (ratio 2). Classification: clean at leading order iff K/S -> 0 like eps (max |K/S| over the 18 omega scales by ~2 per doubling and kappa - 1 = K/S is small), contaminated iff K/S = O(1) (constant). *)\nfmt[x_] := With[{m = N[x]}, If[m == 0., \"0[acc \" <> ToString[Round[Accuracy[x]]] <> \"]\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[m]]]}, ToString[Round[m/10^e, 0.01]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]]];\n{tLoop1, T1} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]]}, t1Point[branchesAt[R[\"z\"]], R]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}]];\nexpo[f_] := Table[Log[Abs[f[ie + 1]/f[ie]]]/Log[2], {ie, 2}];\nnB = Length[hwList];\nexpS = Table[expo[Function[ie, T1[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]]]], {ib, nB}, {io, 18}];\nexpK = Table[If[ib == 1, {{0, 0}}, expo[Function[ie, T1[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]]]], {ib, nB}, {io, 18}];\nexpNorm = Table[expo[Function[ie, T1[[ie, 1, ib, \"normPsi\"]]]], {ib, nB}];\nkap[ie_, io_, ib_] := T1[[ie, io, ib, \"RC\"]]/T1[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]];\nmaxKS[ie_, ib_] := Max[Table[Abs[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]/T1[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]]], {io, 18}]];\nioA = Position[omGrid, {3/4, -1/5}][[1, 1]]; ioB = Position[omGrid, {7/2, -7/4}][[1, 1]];\nchecks[\"T1 exact undo S = s<phi_A(x)e1|P_HW Psi>: max rel dev over 540 points\"] = sz[Max[Table[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"undoRel\"]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}, {ib, nB}]]];\nchecks[\"T1 min Precision of K over all points\"] = Min[Table[Precision[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}, {ib, 2, nB}]];\nrs3 = Table[maxKS[ie, ib], {ie, 3}, {ib, nB}];\nclassOf[ib_] := If[ib == 1, \"exact (single state)\", If[rs3[[1, ib]] < 0.1 && Abs[rs3[[2, ib]]/rs3[[1, ib]] - 2] < 0.3, \"clean (K/S ~ eps)\", If[Abs[rs3[[2, ib]]/rs3[[1, ib]] - 1] < 0.05, \"CONTAMINATED (K/S = O(1))\", \"mixed/other\"]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"S: eps-exp at om A\", \"S: exp range over 18 om\", \"K: exp at om A\", \"K: exp range\", \"||Psi||: exp\", \"kappa(eps) om A\", \"max|K/S| (3 eps)\", \"class\"}}, Table[{hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], ToString[N[expS[[ib, ioA]], 4]], ToString[N[{Min[Flatten[expS[[ib]]]], Max[Flatten[expS[[ib]]]]}, 4]], If[ib == 1, \"K = 0 exactly\", ToString[N[expK[[ib, ioA]], 4]]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", ToString[N[{Min[Flatten[expK[[ib]]]], Max[Flatten[expK[[ib]]]]}, 4]]], ToString[N[expNorm[[ib]], 4]], ToString[N[Table[kap[ie, ioA, ib], {ie, 3}], 8]], ToString[Table[fmt[maxKS[ie, ib]], {ie, 3}]], classOf[ib]}, {ib, nB}], {{\"undo max rel dev\", ScientificForm[checks[\"T1 exact undo S = s<phi_A(x)e1|P_HW Psi>: max rel dev over 540 points\"], 3]}, {\"min Precision(K)\", checks[\"T1 min Precision of K over all points\"]}, {\"time (s)\", tLoop1}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
