  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"S: eps-exp at om A\", \"S: exp range over 18 om\", \"K: exp at om A\", \"K: exp range\", \"||Psi||: exp\", \"kappa(eps) om A\", \n \"max|K/S| (3 eps)\", \"class\"}\n{{6, 2, 0}, 1, \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \"K = 0 exactly\", \"-\", \"{-2.000, -2.000}\", \"{1.0000000, 1.0000000, 1.0000000}\", \n \"{0[acc 191], 0[acc 192], 0[acc 192]}\", \"exact (single state)\"}\n{{6, 1, 1}, 1, \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \"{-3.000, -3.000}\", \n \"{1.0000001, 1.0000002, 1.0000004}\", \"{9.58e-7, 1.92e-6, 3.83e-6}\", \"clean (K/S ~ eps)\"}\n{{5, 3, 0}, 1, \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \"{-3.000, -3.000}\", \n \"{0.99999999, 0.99999998, 0.99999997}\", \"{2.59e-7, 5.19e-7, 1.04e-6}\", \"clean (K/S ~ eps)\"}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 1, \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-4.000, -4.000}\", \n \"{1.0000001, 1.0000002, 1.0000003}\", \"{8.3e-7, 1.66e-6, 3.32e-6}\", \"clean (K/S ~ eps)\"}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 2, \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-4.000, -4.000}\", \n \"{0.99999984, 0.99999968, 0.99999937}\", \"{1.84e-6, 3.69e-6, 7.37e-6}\", \"clean (K/S ~ eps)\"}\n{{4, 4, 0}, 1, \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \"{-4.000, -4.000}\", \n \"{1.3857144, 1.3857144, 1.3857146}\", \"{3.86e-1, 3.86e-1, 3.86e-1}\", \"CONTAMINATED (K/S = O(1))\"}\n{{4, 3, 1}, 1, \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-5.000, -5.000}\", \n \"{1.4105702, 1.4105706, 1.4105712}\", \"{4.11e-1, 4.11e-1, 4.11e-1}\", \"CONTAMINATED (K/S = O(1))\"}\n{{4, 3, 1}, 2, \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -8.000}\", \"{-8.000, -7.999}\", \"{-5.000, -5.000}\", \n \"{0.98671310, 0.98671272, 0.98671195}\", \"{1.33e-2, 1.33e-2, 1.33e-2}\", \"CONTAMINATED (K/S = O(1))\"}\n{{4, 2, 2}, 1, \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-6.000, -6.000}\", \n \"{1.3661018, 1.3661019, 1.3661021}\", \"{3.66e-1, 3.66e-1, 3.66e-1}\", \"CONTAMINATED (K/S = O(1))\"}\n{{3, 3, 2}, 1, \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-9.000, -9.000}\", \"{-7.000, -7.000}\", \n \"{4.6508004, 4.6507973, 4.6507910}\", \"{3.65e0, 3.65e0, 3.65e0}\", \"CONTAMINATED (K/S = O(1))\"}\n{\"undo max rel dev\", ScientificForm[4.935499867118927*^-138, 3]}\n{\"min Precision(K)\", 137.56802514107446}\n{\"time (s)\", 9.9585059}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
