  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* contamination breakdown: K = <v1(x)v2|Psi_perp> = <phi_A(x)e1|R Psi_perp> with R = rho(n_A)(x)rho(n_A) (site-2 vacuum rotation), phi_A = v1 rho(n_A)^-1 (s = 1). Sum over site-1 components a of phi_a [R Psi_perp]_(a,1), grouped by the GT weight nu of a: c_nu. Reported at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6 (om A) for every contaminated branch: only weights with |c_nu/K| > 1e-6, with the eps-exponent of c_nu and its fraction of K. *)\ncontamAt[R_, ib_] := Module[{zz = R[\"z\"], w1 = R[\"w1\"], w2 = R[\"w2\"], y = R[\"y\"], b, psi, perp, Rn, Rp, ph, terms},\n  b = brOf[branchesAt[zz], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]; psi = b[\"psi\"]; perp = psi - PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][psi];\n  Rn = N[u12rN[zz, w1, y], pr]; Rp = (KroneckerProduct[Rn, Rn]) . perp;\n  ph = N[phiA[zz, w1, w2], pr];\n  terms = Table[ph[[a]] Rp[[(a - 1) d1 + 1]], {a, d1}];\n  <|\"c\" -> Table[Total[terms[[ix]]], {ix, u12idx}], \"K\" -> Total[terms], \"Kdirect\" -> N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[vA1[zz, w1, w2], vA2[zz, w1, w2]]], pr] . perp|>];\ncontamTab[ib_] := Module[{c = Table[contamAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], ib], {ie, 2}]},\n  Select[Table[{u12wts[[m]], fmt[c[[1, \"c\", m]]], fmt[c[[2, \"c\", m]]], If[c[[1, \"c\", m]] == 0, \"-\", ToString[Round[Log[Abs[c[[2, \"c\", m]]/c[[1, \"c\", m]]]]/Log[2], 0.01]]], fmt[Abs[c[[1, \"c\", m]]/c[[1, \"K\"]]]], N[Abs[c[[1, \"c\", m]]/c[[1, \"K\"]]]]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}], #[[6]] > 10^-6 &][[All, 1 ;; 5]]];\ncontIb = Flatten[Position[Table[classOf[ib], {ib, nB}], s_String /; StringStartsQ[s, \"CONT\"]]];\nctTabs = Table[{hwList[[ib]], contamTab[ib]}, {ib, contIb}];\ncK = Table[contamAt[reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], ib], {ib, contIb}];\nchecks[\"T1 contamination: sum_nu c_nu = K = <v1(x)v2|Psi_perp> (max rel dev over contaminated branches)\"] = sz[Max[Table[Abs[c[\"K\"]/c[\"Kdirect\"] - 1], {c, cK}]]];\nGrid[Join[Flatten[Table[Join[{{\"BRANCH (mu, copy) = \" <> ToString[t[[1]]], \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}}, Table[{ToString[r[[1]]], r[[2]], r[[3]], r[[4]], r[[5]]}, {r, t[[2]]}]], {t, ctTabs}], 1], {{\"sum c_nu = K check (max rel dev)\", ScientificForm[checks[\"T1 contamination: sum_nu c_nu = K = <v1(x)v2|Psi_perp> (max rel dev over contaminated branches)\"], 3], \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"BRANCH (mu, copy) = {{4, 4, 0}, 1}\", \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}\n{\"{2, 2, 0}\", \"-4.97e45\", \"-3.89e43\", \"-7.\", \"10.e-1\"}\n{\"BRANCH (mu, copy) = {{4, 3, 1}, 1}\", \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}\n{\"{2, 1, 1}\", \"-1.15e53\", \"-4.51e50\", \"-8.\", \"10.e-1\"}\n{\"BRANCH (mu, copy) = {{4, 3, 1}, 2}\", \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}\n{\"{1, 2, 1}\", \"2.34e46\", \"1.82e44\", \"-7.\", \"1.59e-5\"}\n{\"{1, 3, 0}\", \"-6.08e46\", \"-4.75e44\", \"-7.\", \"4.14e-5\"}\n{\"{2, 1, 1}\", \"-1.47e51\", \"-5.74e48\", \"-8.\", \"10.e-1\"}\n{\"{2, 2, 0}\", \"-6.25e45\", \"-4.88e43\", \"-7.\", \"4.25e-6\"}\n{\"BRANCH (mu, copy) = {{4, 2, 2}, 1}\", \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}\n{\"{1, 1, 2}\", \"-1.99e53\", \"-7.77e50\", \"-8.\", \"1.03e-6\"}\n{\"{1, 2, 1}\", \"3.32e53\", \"1.3e51\", \"-8.\", \"1.73e-6\"}\n{\"{2, 0, 2}\", \"1.92e59\", \"3.76e56\", \"-9.\", \"10.e-1\"}\n{\"BRANCH (mu, copy) = {{3, 3, 2}, 1}\", \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}\n{\"{1, 1, 2}\", \"1.1e60\", \"2.15e57\", \"-9.\", \"8.47e-1\"}\n{\"{2, 0, 2}\", \"2.e59\", \"3.9e56\", \"-9.\", \"1.53e-1\"}\n{\"sum c_nu = K check (max rel dev)\", ScientificForm[3.2899672426746796*^-140, 3], \"\", \"\", \"\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
