  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Task 1 result.** Exact undo S = s <phi_A (x) e1|P_HW Psi> holds to 4.9e-138 at all 540 points (3 eps x 18 om x 10 branches); min Precision(K) = 137.6. Time: 56 states 3.1 s per eps; 540-point loop 10.2 s. rr separation (branch rr ~ 1e-7 vs next >= 1.41). Dual Q's of the 56 states: Baxter residual 2.4e-140.\n\n| branch (mu, copy) | slice weight nu | eps-exp S | K | ||Psi|| | kappa = R_C/S at om A (eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6) | max abs K/S over 18 om at the 3 eps | class |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [6,2,0] | (3,1,0) | -6 | K = 0 exactly | -2 | 1 | 0 | exact |\n| [6,1,1] | (3,0,1) | -7 | -6 | -3 | 1.0000001, 1.0000002, 1.0000004 | 9.6e-7, 1.9e-6, 3.8e-6 | clean |\n| [5,3,0] | (2,2,0) | -7 | -6 | -3 | 0.99999999, 0.99999998, 0.99999997 | 2.6e-7, 5.2e-7, 1.0e-6 | clean |\n| [5,2,1] #1 | (2,1,1) | -8 | -7 | -4 | 1.0000001, 1.0000002, 1.0000003 | 8.3e-7, 1.7e-6, 3.3e-6 | clean |\n| [5,2,1] #2 | (2,1,1) | -8 | -7 | -4 | 0.99999984, 0.99999968, 0.99999937 | 1.8e-6, 3.7e-6, 7.4e-6 | clean |\n| [4,4,0] | (1,3,0) | -7 | -7 | -4 | 1.3857144 (constant) | 0.386 at every eps | CONTAMINATED |\n| [4,3,1] #1 | (1,2,1) | -8 | -8 | -5 | 1.4105702 | 0.411 | CONTAMINATED |\n| [4,3,1] #2 | (1,2,1) | -8 | -8 | -5 | 0.98671310, 0.98671272, 0.98671195 | 0.0133 | CONTAMINATED (small) |\n| [4,2,2] | (1,1,2) | -9 | -9 | -6 | 1.3661018 | 0.366 | CONTAMINATED |\n| [3,3,2] | (0,2,2) | -9 | -9 | -7 | 4.6508004 | 3.65 | CONTAMINATED |\n\n(The S exponent = -4 (delta^Lambda) + exponent of ||Psi|| + leading covector order of Task 0: e.g. [4,4,0]: -4 -4 +1 = -7, [3,3,2]: -4 -7 +2 = -9.) The clean set is exactly the set of branches whose slice weight is at eps^0 in Task 0; the contaminated set is the branches whose slice weight is at eps^1 or eps^2 (K, which comes from the eps^0 weights next door, then has the same order as S).\n\n**Contamination carriers** (eps = 1e-6 and 2e-6, all c_nu scale like S; sum_nu c_nu = K to 3.3e-140): [4,4,0]: (2,2,0) 100%. [4,3,1] #1: (2,1,1) 100%. [4,3,1] #2: (2,1,1) ~100% (plus (1,2,1) 1.6e-5, (1,3,0) 4.1e-5, (2,2,0) 4.3e-6 of K). [4,2,2]: (2,0,2) ~100% ((1,1,2) 1.0e-6, (1,2,1) 1.7e-6). [3,3,2]: (1,1,2) 85%, (2,0,2) 15%.\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 2. Q side at small epsilon and the CG numbers from the Q's alone",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 2. R_Q(B) = det6[B, Fvac(w1,w2,w3)]/psiQ[B] x det2^(0,1,2)[B; y_A]/W(3,4)[B], y_A = w2 y0. Vacuum direct Q's of the twist (w1, w2, w3 = 1 + 5 eps/13; w3 drops out of the identity and 5/13 never coincides with an om2 of the grid, whereas the adjoint's 2/9 does). Qnum(B) = R_Q(B)/R_Q(top) <v1(x)v2|e1(x)e1>/<x0|e1(x)e1>. *)\nrQ[st_, vq_, y_] := det6[st, vq[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st] det2P[st, N[y, pr], Pset]/minor1[st];\nvqAt[R_] := vacQs[R[\"w\"]];\nq2Point[ie_, io_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]], B, vq, rq, V, x0, topFac, qnum},\n  B = branchesAt[R[\"z\"]]; vq = vqAt[R];\n  rq = Table[rQ[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], vq, R[\"y\"]], {ib, nB}];\n  V = vecsAt[R]; x0 = x0Of[N[R[\"z\"], pr]];\n  topFac = (V[\"v12\"] . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12);\n  qnum = rq/rq[[1]] topFac;\n  <|\"rq\" -> rq, \"qnum\" -> qnum, \"vqres\" -> vq[\"res\"], \"vqdeg\" -> Exponent[vq[\"q\"], X]|>];\n(* time one parameter point: vacuum Q's, R_Q for the 10 branches *)\nR1 = reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\n{tVq, vq1} = AbsoluteTiming[vqAt[R1]];\nB1 = branchesAt[R1[\"z\"]];\n{tRq, rq1} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[rQ[brOf[B1, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], vq1, R1[\"y\"]], {ib, nB}]];\nrc1 = Table[T1[[1, ioA, ib, \"RC\"]], {ib, nB}];\n(* full loop: 3 eps x 18 omega *)\n{tT2, T2} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[q2Point[ie, io], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}]];\nrcOf[ie_, io_] := Table[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"RC\"]], {ib, nB}];\nratioDev = Table[With[{r = rcOf[ie, io]/T2[[ie, io, \"rq\"]]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}];\nqnumDev = Table[Max[Abs[T2[[ie, io, \"qnum\"]]/rcOf[ie, io] - 1]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}];\nchecks[\"T2 time (s): vacuum Q's, R_Q x10, full loop (54 points)\"] = {tVq, tRq, tT2};\nchecks[\"T2 max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's (54 twists), dual Q's (3 eps, 56 states)\"] = {Max[Table[T2[[ie, io, \"vqres\"]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}]], Max[Table[Max[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]][\"states\"][[All, \"bax\"]]], {ie, 3}]]};\nchecks[\"T2 vacuum Q degrees all (0,4,6)\"] = Union[Flatten[Table[T2[[ie, io, \"vqdeg\"]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}], 2]];\nchecks[\"T2 R_C/R_Q state independence over 10 branches: max over 18 om, per eps\"] = Table[sz[Max[ratioDev[[ie]]]], {ie, 3}];\nchecks[\"T2 Qnum = R_C: max rel dev over 54 points x 10 branches, per eps\"] = Table[sz[Max[qnumDev[[ie]]]], {ie, 3}];\nchecks[\"T2 min Precision(R_Q)\"] = Min[Table[Precision[T2[[ie, io, \"rq\"]]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}]];\n(* all states of the 8 HW sectors (56) at one parameter point per eps (om A): R_C/R_Q state independence *)\nall56[ie_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], B, vq, V, rc, rq},\n  B = branchesAt[R[\"z\"]]; vq = vqAt[R]; V = vecsAt[R];\n  rc = Table[V[\"v12\"] . s[\"psi\"], {s, B[\"states\"]}]; rq = Table[rQ[s[\"st\"], vq, R[\"y\"]], {s, B[\"states\"]}];\n  With[{r = rc/rq}, {Length[rc], sz[Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]], Min[Precision /@ rq]}]];\nchecks[\"T2 56 HW-sector states at om A: (count, max|ratio/ratio_1 - 1|, min Precision R_Q), eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6\"] = Table[all56[ie], {ie, 3}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): vacuum Q's; R_Q x10; 54-point loop\", ToString[{tVq, tRq, tT2}]}, {\"max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's, dual Q's\", ToString[N[checks[\"T2 max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's (54 twists), dual Q's (3 eps, 56 states)\"], 3]]}, {\"vacuum Q degrees\", ToString[checks[\"T2 vacuum Q degrees all (0,4,6)\"]]}, {\"R_C/R_Q over 10 branches, max over 18 om, eps 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6\", ToString[checks[\"T2 R_C/R_Q state independence over 10 branches: max over 18 om, per eps\"]]}, {\"Qnum = R_C max rel dev (per eps)\", ToString[checks[\"T2 Qnum = R_C: max rel dev over 54 points x 10 branches, per eps\"]]}, {\"min Precision R_Q\", checks[\"T2 min Precision(R_Q)\"]}}, {{\"56 states at om A (count, max dev, Precision)\", ToString[N[#, 4] & /@ checks[\"T2 56 HW-sector states at om A: (count, max|ratio/ratio_1 - 1|, min Precision R_Q), eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6\"]]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
