  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"time (s): vacuum Q's; R_Q x10; 54-point loop\", \"{0.0731999, 0.169163, 13.1749}\"}\n{\"max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's, dual Q's\", \"        -189         -140\\n{2.61 10    , 2.38 10    }\"}\n{\"vacuum Q degrees\", \"{0, 4, 6}\"}\n{\"R_C/R_Q over 10 branches, max over 18 om, eps 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6\", \"        -82         -86         -93\\n{2.45 10   , 3.74 10   , 8.91 10   }\"}\n{\"Qnum = R_C max rel dev (per eps)\", \"        -82         -86         -93\\n{2.45 10   , 3.74 10   , 8.91 10   }\"}\n{\"min Precision R_Q\", 103.68537327274409}\n{\"56 states at om A (count, max dev, Precision)\", \"                -77                           -85                           -87\\n{{56.00, 6.35 10  \\\n , 103.685}, {56.00, 2.02 10   , 107.599}, {56.00, 2.83 10   , 111.512}}\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
