  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* CG extraction from Qnum alone at leading order, for every CLEAN branch (Task 1: [6,2,0], [6,1,1], [5,3,0], [5,2,1] x2). Chain side: C_B(eps) = f . [P_HW Psi_B]_(site-1 weight nu, site 2 = e1), nu = mu - Lambda, f = 1 for the 1-dim weights and f = hat = U for the dim-2 weight (2,1,1), U = e1 E12 E23 on its two GT indices (the one direction seen at eps^0). Q side: C^Q(om, eps) = Qnum/(delta^Lambda fac(om)), delta^Lambda = d1^3 d2 (the explicit prefactor of v1), fac = the component of the eps = 0 covector phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda = e1 (1 + (a'0/2) E12) e^{c'0 E23} (Task 0, exact) at the branch's site-1 weight: 1 for (3,1,0); c'0 for (3,0,1); a'0 for (2,2,0) [the GT matrix element of e1 E12 is 2, so the E12 coefficient a'0/2 gives a'0]; (a'0 c'0/2) U for (2,1,1). *)\na0G[ph_, om_] := (om[[1]] - ph[[1]]) (ph[[2]] - ph[[1]])/((om[[1]] - ph[[2]]) (om[[2]] - ph[[2]]));\nc0G[ph_, om_] := ((om[[1]] - ph[[2]]) (ph[[1]] - ph[[3]])/((ph[[1]] - ph[[2]]) (om[[1]] - ph[[3]])) (ph[[3]] - ph[[2]]))/(om[[2]] - ph[[3]]);\nphi0G[ph_, om_] := u12e1 . (IdentityMatrix[d1] + (a0G[ph, om]/2) Normal[Ee[1, 2]]) . expN[c0G[ph, om] Ee[2, 3]];\nidx211 = idxOf[{2, 1, 1}];\nuHat = (u12e1 . Ee[1, 2] . Ee[2, 3])[[idx211]];\n(* the closed form against the exact eps -> 0 limit of phi_A/delta^Lambda, 18 om x 2 directions (limit = series coefficient 0) *)\nchecks[\"T2 closed form phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda = e1(1 + a'0/2 E12) e^{c'0 E23}: all 15 components, 18 om, phi and phi'\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Table[Limit[#, epsS -> 0] & /@ phiScaledS[ph, o[[1]], o[[2]]] === phi0G[ph, o], {o, omGrid}], {ph, {phiP, phiC}}]];\nchecks[\"T2 (2,1,1) component of phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda = (a'0 c'0/2) U for all 18 om; U\"] = {And @@ Table[phi0G[phiP, o][[idx211]] === a0G[phiP, o] c0G[phiP, o]/2 uHat, {o, omGrid}], uHat};\ncgSpec = {{1, {3, 1, 0}, 1 &, {1}}, {2, {3, 0, 1}, c0G[phiP, #] &, {1}}, {3, {2, 2, 0}, a0G[phiP, #] &, {1}}, {4, {2, 1, 1}, a0G[phiP, #] c0G[phiP, #]/2 &, uHat}, {5, {2, 1, 1}, a0G[phiP, #] c0G[phiP, #]/2 &, uHat}};\nchainC[ie_, ib_] := With[{sp = cgSpec[[ib]], b = brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]}, With[{ph = PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][b[\"psi\"]]}, sp[[4]] . ph[[(idxOf[sp[[2]]] - 1) d1 + 1]]]];\nqC[ie_, io_, ib_] := With[{sp = cgSpec[[ib]], R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]]}, T2[[ie, io, \"qnum\"]][[ib]]/(deltaL[R] sp[[3]][omGrid[[io]]])];\ncgTab = Table[With[{cc = Table[chainC[ie, ib], {ie, 3}], qq = Table[qC[ie, io, ib], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}]}, {hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], Table[{N[Max[Abs[qq[[ie]]/Mean[qq[[ie]]] - 1]], 4], N[Max[Abs[qq[[ie]]/cc[[ie]] - 1]], 4]}, {ie, 3}]}], {ib, 5}];\ncgScal = Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], If[r[[3, 1, 1]] == 0, \"-\", N[r[[3, 3, 1]]/r[[3, 1, 1]], 3]], If[r[[3, 1, 2]] == 0, \"-\", N[r[[3, 3, 2]]/r[[3, 1, 2]], 3]]}, {r, cgTab}];\n(* Richardson in eps at om A: f(eps) = C(eps) eps^p, p = -(eps-exponent of ||Psi||) (2,3,3,4,4); R1(e) = 2 f(e) - f(2e) removes O(eps), R2 = (4 R1(e) - R1(2e))/3 removes O(eps^2) *)\nrich[f_] := Module[{r1 = 2 f[[1]] - f[[2]], r2 = 2 f[[2]] - f[[3]]}, {r1, r2, (4 r1 - r2)/3}];\npB = Round[-expNorm[[All, 1]]];\nrichTab = Table[Module[{fc, fq, rc, rq},\n  fc = Table[chainC[ie, ib] epsL[[ie]]^pB[[ib]], {ie, 3}]; fq = Table[qC[ie, ioA, ib] epsL[[ie]]^pB[[ib]], {ie, 3}];\n  rc = rich[fc]; rq = rich[fq];\n  {hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], pB[[ib]], rc[[3]], rq[[3]], Abs[rq[[3]]/rc[[3]] - 1], Max[Abs[fq/fc - 1]], Abs[fq[[1]]/rq[[3]] - 1], Abs[rc[[3]]/rc[[1]] - 1]}], {ib, 5}];\nchecks[\"T2 Richardson (mu, copy, p, chain limit, Q limit, |Q/chain-1|, max_eps|fQ/fchain-1|, |fQ(1e-6)/limQ-1|, |lim/R1 - 1|)\"] = richTab;\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"(spread over 18 om, error vs chain) at eps = 1e-6\", \"... 2e-6\", \"... 4e-6\", \"scaling 4e-6/1e-6: spread, error\"}}, Table[{cgTab[[i, 1]], cgTab[[i, 2]], ToString[cgTab[[i, 3, 1]]], ToString[cgTab[[i, 3, 2]]], ToString[cgTab[[i, 3, 3]]], ToString[cgScal[[i, 3 ;; 4]]]}, {i, 5}], {{\"Richardson: mu, copy, p, chain limit, Q limit, |Q/chain - 1|, max_eps |fQ/fc - 1|, |fQ(1e-6)/limQ - 1|\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], r[[3]], N[Re[r[[4]]], 14], N[Re[r[[5]]], 14], ToString[{ScientificForm[N[r[[6]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[r[[7]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[r[[8]], 3]]}]}, {r, richTab}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
