   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"(spread over 18 om, error vs chain) at eps = 1e-6\", \"... 2e-6\", \"... 4e-6\", \"scaling 4e-6/1e-6: spread, error\"}\n{{6, 2, 0}, 1, \"      -131       -131\\n{0. 10    , 0. 10    }\", \"      -134       -134\\n{0. 10    , 0. 10    }\", \n \"      -137       -137\\n{0. 10    , 0. 10    }\", \"{-, -}\"}\n{{6, 1, 1}, 1, \"         -7          -7\\n{8.502 10  , 7.891 10  }\", \"         -6          -6\\n{1.700 10  , 1.578 10  }\", \n \"         -6          -6\\n{3.401 10  , 3.156 10  }\", \"{4.00, 4.00}\"}\n{{5, 3, 0}, 1, \"         -6          -6\\n{1.952 10  , 1.855 10  }\", \"         -6          -6\\n{3.904 10  , 3.710 10  }\", \n \"         -6          -6\\n{7.809 10  , 7.420 10  }\", \"{4.00, 4.00}\"}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 1, \"         -6          -6\\n{4.190 10  , 3.957 10  }\", \"         -6          -6\\n{8.380 10  , 7.914 10  }\", \"{0.00001676, 0.00001583}\", \n \"{4.00, 4.00}\"}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 2, \"         -6          -6\\n{2.146 10  , 2.452 10  }\", \"         -6          -6\\n{4.291 10  , 4.903 10  }\", \n \"         -6          -6\\n{8.583 10  , 9.806 10  }\", \"{4.00, 4.00}\"}\n{\"Richardson: mu, copy, p, chain limit, Q limit, |Q/chain - 1|, max_eps |fQ/fc - 1|, |fQ(1e-6)/limQ - 1|\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}\n{{6, 2, 0}, 1, 2, 2.60946745562130177514792899408284023669`14., 2.60946745562130177514792899408284023669`14., \n \"        -131         -131         -130\\n{0. × 10    , 0. × 10    , 0. × 10    }\"}\n{{6, 1, 1}, 1, 3, 46.67453891138101664186650214244941715801`14., 46.67453891138101663646189529988640041865`14., \n \"          -19           -7           -8\\n{1.16 × 10   , 2.38 × 10  , 2.49 × 10  }\"}\n{{5, 3, 0}, 1, 3, -36.88381884387801547568487541847403012206`14., -36.88381884387801547370654515096203303228`14., \n \"          -20           -7           -8\\n{5.36 × 10   , 3.74 × 10  , 6.98 × 10  }\"}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 1, 4, -1325.40236653330727592867463529238183663085`14., -1325.40236653330727578249356187063373077478`14., \n \"          -19           -7           -7\\n{1.10 × 10   , 9.01 × 10  , 3.35 × 10  }\"}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 2, 4, -334.3316171624337035803984175102690848026`14., -334.331617162433703621994745924883227909`14., \n \"          -19           -6           -8\\n{1.24 × 10   , 1.24 × 10  , 5.39 × 10  }\"}\n```",
