  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Task 2 result.** Q side: vacuum direct Q's (degrees (0,4,6)) of the 54 twists (w1,w2,w3), Baxter residual <= 2.6e-189 (exact arithmetic); the 56 dual Q's of the HW sectors: 2.4e-140. R_C/R_Q is state-independent over the 10 branches: max over 18 om 2.5e-82, 3.7e-86, 8.9e-93 at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 (limited by Precision(R_Q) >= 103.7 digits); over **all 56 states of the 8 HW sectors** at om A: 6.4e-77, 2.0e-85, 2.8e-87 (Precision 103.7, 107.6, 111.5). Qnum = R_C to the same level. Times: one point (vacuum Q's + 10 R_Q) 0.23 s; 54-point loop 13.2 s.\n\nLeading-order extraction for the 5 clean branches (C^Q = Qnum/(delta^Lambda fac); fac = component of phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda at the slice weight: 1, c'0, a'0 [the GT matrix element of e1 E12 is 2, so the E12 coefficient a'0/2 gives a'0], (a'0 c'0/2) u' for (2,1,1) with f = u' = (2,8)):\n\n| branch | (spread over 18 om, error vs chain) at eps = 1e-6 | eps = 4e-6 | scaling | Richardson limit chain / Q | abs(Q/chain - 1) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [6,2,0] | 0, 0 (1e-131) | 0 | - | 2.609467455621302 / same | 0 |\n| [6,1,1] | 8.5e-7, 7.9e-7 | 3.4e-6, 3.2e-6 | x4.00 | 46.67453891138102 / 46.67453891138102 | 1.2e-19 |\n| [5,3,0] | 2.0e-6, 1.9e-6 | 7.8e-6, 7.4e-6 | x4.00 | -36.88381884387802 / -36.88381884387802 | 5.4e-20 |\n| [5,2,1] #1 | 4.2e-6, 4.0e-6 | 1.7e-5, 1.6e-5 | x4.00 | -1325.402366533307 / -1325.402366533307 | 1.1e-19 |\n| [5,2,1] #2 | 2.1e-6, 2.5e-6 | 8.6e-6, 9.8e-6 | x4.00 | -334.3316171624337 / -334.3316171624337 | 1.2e-19 |\n\n(Richardson of f(eps) = C eps^p with p = 2,3,3,4,4; second-order three-point extrapolation. The top value 2.6094674556 and the [6,1,1] value 46.6745389114 coincide with the adjoint's 27 and [4,1,1] values.) For the [5,2,1] pair only the functional u'.C is read at leading order; C itself needs the eps^1 layer (Task 3).\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 3. The O(eps) layer: diagnostics",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 3. Top-killed quantities: T = delta^Lambda s <v2(x)v2|Psi_B>/<x0|Psi_B> (the plain vacuum overlap of the twist (w1, y_A), s = (v2)_1 = 1; for a non-top branch <v2(x)v2|P_HW Psi> = 0 since rho(n)(x)rho(n) fixes the HW kets, so T is pure contamination), R_C^tk = R_C - T, K^tk = K - T, rho_B = K^tk/S. First the Q-number identity <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[B, Fvac(w1,y_A,w3)]/psiQ[B] x top normalization (the (w1,y_A)-vacuum det6; no det2 factor). *)\nt3Data[ph_, ie_, om_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, om[[1]], om[[2]]], B, zz, v2, v2v2, dl, p1},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; p1 = t1Point[B, R]; dl = deltaL[R];\n  v2 = vA2[zz, R[\"w1\"], R[\"w2\"]]; v2v2 = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v2, v2]], pr];\n  Table[With[{psi = brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"psi\"], d = p1[[ib]]}, With[{T = dl v2[[1]] (v2v2 . psi)}, <|\"S\" -> d[\"S\"], \"K\" -> d[\"K\"], \"RC\" -> d[\"RC\"], \"T\" -> T, \"RCtk\" -> d[\"RC\"] - T, \"Ktk\" -> d[\"K\"] - T, \"rho\" -> (d[\"K\"] - T)/d[\"S\"]|>]], {ib, nB}]];\nqT[ie_, om_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, om[[1]], om[[2]]], B, zz, v2, v2v2, x0, vq, rt, topOv, sts},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; v2 = vA2[zz, R[\"w1\"], R[\"w2\"]]; v2v2 = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v2, v2]], pr]; x0 = x0Of[N[zz, pr]];\n  sts = Table[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]], {ib, nB}];\n  vq = vacQs[{R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"], 1 + R[\"eps\"] 5/13}];\n  rt = Table[det6[b[\"st\"], vq[\"F\"]]/psiQ[b[\"st\"]], {b, sts}];\n  topOv = (v2v2 . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12);\n  <|\"vacRes\" -> vq[\"res\"], \"dev\" -> Max[Table[Abs[rt[[ib]]/rt[[1]] topOv/(v2v2 . sts[[ib]][\"psi\"]) - 1], {ib, nB}]], \"Tq\" -> deltaL[R] v2[[1]] rt/rt[[1]] topOv|>];\nqTr = qT[1, {3/4, -1/5}];\nchecks[\"T3 <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[Fvac(w1,y_A)]/psiQ x top normalization (10 branches): max rel dev, vac Baxter residual, Precision\"] = {sz[qTr[\"dev\"]], qTr[\"vacRes\"], Precision[qTr[\"dev\"]]};\n{tT3, T3a} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[t3Data[phiP, ie, om], {ie, 3}, {om, omGrid}]];\n(* exponents of S, K, T, R_C^tk, K^tk and of rho_B = K^tk/S, 1e-6 -> 4e-6 (per doubling), at om A; and max over 18 om of |rho_B| at 1e-6 *)\ne3[ie_, io_, ib_, key_] := T3a[[ie, io, ib, key]];\nexpOf[io_, ib_, key_] := Log[Abs[e3[2, io, ib, key]/e3[1, io, ib, key]]]/Log[2];\nGrid[Join[{{\"Q-number identity <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[Fvac(w1,y_A,w3)]/psiQ x top normalization: max rel dev (10 branches), vacuum Baxter residual, Precision(dev)\", ToString[checks[\"T3 <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[Fvac(w1,y_A)]/psiQ x top normalization (10 branches): max rel dev, vac Baxter residual, Precision\"]]}, {\"mu\", \"copy\", \"exp S\", \"exp K\", \"exp T\", \"exp K^tk\", \"exp R_C^tk\", \"rho = K^tk/S at eps 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 (om A)\", \"T/K at 1e-6\", \"K^tk/K\"}}, Table[{hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", N[expOf[ioA, ib, \"S\"], 4]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", N[expOf[ioA, ib, \"K\"], 4]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", N[expOf[ioA, ib, \"T\"], 4]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", N[expOf[ioA, ib, \"Ktk\"], 4]], N[expOf[ioA, ib, \"RCtk\"], 4], If[ib == 1, \"-\", ToString[N[Table[e3[ie, ioA, ib, \"rho\"], {ie, 3}], 6]]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", N[e3[1, ioA, ib, \"T\"]/e3[1, ioA, ib, \"K\"], 6]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", N[e3[1, ioA, ib, \"Ktk\"]/e3[1, ioA, ib, \"K\"], 6]]}, {ib, nB}], {{\"time (s)\", tT3, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
