  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"Q-number identity <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[Fvac(w1,y_A,w3)]/psiQ x top normalization: max rel dev (10 branches), vacuum Baxter residual, \\\nPrecision(dev)\", \"        -82            -194\\n{2.45 10   , 9.45149 10    , 35.5888}\"}\n{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"exp S\", \"exp K\", \"exp T\", \"exp K^tk\", \"exp R_C^tk\", \"rho = K^tk/S at eps 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 (om A)\", \"T/K at 1e-6\", \"K^tk/K\"}\n{{6, 2, 0}, 1, \"-\", \"-\", \"-\", \"-\", Indeterminate, \"-\", \"-\", \"-\"}\n{{6, 1, 1}, 1, -7.0000001223210652075`4., -6.0000002441073117121`4., -6.0000002441073117121`4., -6.0000002441073117121`4., -7.0000003282865180009`4., \n \"            -7             -7             -7\\n{-1.42764 10  , -2.85529 10  , -5.71057 10  }\", 2.3013698630136986302`6., -1.3013698630136986302`6.}\n{{5, 3, 0}, 1, -7.0000000893098384678`4., -6.000000277168330228`4., -6.`4., -6.0000001236596968264`4., -7.000000114826892467`4., \n \"            -8             -8             -8\\n{-1.76871 10  , -3.53741 10  , -7.07483 10  }\", -1.2413795488365331879`6., 2.2413795488365331879`6.}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 1, -8.0000005954294298068`4., -7.0000006227601603681`4., -6.000000240949315317`4., -7.0000006750764928902`4., -8.0000004834676516402`4., \n \"           -8            -7            -7\\n{7.76060 10  , 1.55212 10  , 3.10424 10  }\", 3.626289721842575292585627182081`6.*^-8, \n 0.9999999637371027815`6.}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 2, -7.999999693733135086`4., -7.0000000136133018573`4., -6.0000072842633409885`4., -7.0000000074522764874`4., -7.9999999222595928123`4., \n \"            -7             -7             -7\\n{-1.58403 10  , -3.16805 10  , -6.33610 10  }\", -4.27054043564251800943761250631`6.*^-9, \n 1.0000000042705404357`6.}\n{{4, 4, 0}, 1, -6.9999995191006511094`4., -6.999999220813553307`4., -6.`4., -6.9999992302352200333`4., -6.9999994386947920425`4., \n \"{0.385714, 0.385714, 0.385715}\", 6.53060871777554937804650911666`6.*^-9, 0.9999999934693912822`6.}\n{{4, 3, 1}, 1, -8.0000005220187095341`4., -7.9999994306926042477`4., -6.0000002077060649717`4., -7.9999994306926098995`4., -8.0000002043697717268`4., \n \"{0.410570, 0.410571, 0.410571}\", 1.30584805354625738228386`6.*^-15, 0.9999999999999986941`6.}\n{{4, 3, 1}, 2, -7.9999987131225704335`4., -7.99995707261051553`4., -6.0000007058011802998`4., -7.9999570726106443037`4., -7.9999992738542539444`4., \n \"{-0.0132869, -0.0132873, -0.0132880}\", 2.975425679374843952991135`6.*^-14, 0.9999999999999702458`6.}\n{{4, 2, 2}, 1, -8.999999613480551712`4., -8.9999991698696962891`4., -6.0000010023281954258`4., -8.9999991698696962891`4., -8.9999994945972054058`4., \n \"{0.366102, 0.366102, 0.366102}\", -9.1363547991291192`6.*^-22, 1.`6.}\n{{3, 3, 2}, 1, -8.9999982093096635379`4., -8.9999994518171917339`4., -6.000000640031238707`4., -8.9999994518171917339`4., -8.9999991846571689275`4., \n \"{3.65080, 3.65080, 3.65079}\", -7.806481399796078`6.*^-23, 1.`6.}\n{\"time (s)\", 1.8036174, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
