  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 3 prerequisite (exact): the (2,1,1) component of phi_A/delta^Lambda in the words u = e1 E13 and u' = e1 E12 E23 restricted to the two GT indices of (2,1,1): phi_(2,1,1)/delta^Lambda = A_u(eps) u + A_u'(eps) u'. Convention (stated once): u = (e1.E13)[idx211], u' = (e1.E12.E23)[idx211]; R := (u.C)/(u'.C) for a CG slice C (the second direction over the first). A_u = O(eps), A_u'(0) = fac0 = a'0 c'0/2 (so u' is the eps^0 direction). Expansions a_u = eps a_u1 + ..., A_u' = fac0 + eps a_u'1 + ... *)\nuW = (u12e1 . Ee[1, 3])[[idx211]]; upW = (u12e1 . Ee[1, 2] . Ee[2, 3])[[idx211]];\nchecks[\"T3 u, u' independent on (2,1,1), u, u'\"] = {MatrixRank[{uW, upW}], uW, upW};\nuBasisInv = Inverse[Transpose[{uW, upW}]];\nadecomp[ph_, o1_, o2_] := Module[{c = serC[#, 2] & /@ phiScaledS[ph, o1, o2][[idx211]], co},\n  co = Table[uBasisInv . (c[[All, j]]), {j, 3}];   (* co[[j]] = {A_u, A_u'} eps^(j-1) coefficients *)\n  <|\"u\" -> co[[All, 1]], \"up\" -> co[[All, 2]]|>];\nadAll = Table[adecomp[phiP, o[[1]], o[[2]]], {o, omGrid}];\nfac0Of[ph_, o_] := a0G[ph, o] c0G[ph, o]/2;\nchecks[\"T3 A_u eps^0 coefficient = 0; A_u'(0) = fac0 = a'0 c'0/2 (18 om)\"] = {And @@ Table[adAll[[i, \"u\"]][[1]] === 0, {i, 18}], And @@ Table[adAll[[i, \"up\"]][[1]] === fac0Of[phiP, omGrid[[i]]], {i, 18}]};\n(* eps^1 coefficients relative to fac0: p1 = A_u'^(1)/fac0, q1 = A_u^(1)/fac0, as functions of om2 at fixed om1: exact straight-line test *)\np1Of = Table[adAll[[i, \"up\"]][[2]]/fac0Of[phiP, omGrid[[i]]], {i, 18}]; q1Of = Table[adAll[[i, \"u\"]][[2]]/fac0Of[phiP, omGrid[[i]]], {i, 18}];\nlineFitEx[xs_, ys_] := Module[{xm = Mean[xs], ym = Mean[ys], sl}, sl = Total[(xs - xm) (ys - ym)]/Total[(xs - xm)^2]; {sl, ym - sl xm, Max[Abs[ys - (ym - sl xm + sl xs)]]}];\nlnTab = Table[{om1s[[i1]], lineFitEx[om2s, p1Of[[(i1 - 1) 6 + Range[6]]]], lineFitEx[om2s, q1Of[[(i1 - 1) 6 + Range[6]]]]}, {i1, 3}];\nGrid[Join[List @@@ Select[Normal[checks], StringStartsQ[#[[1]], \"T3 u\"] || StringStartsQ[#[[1]], \"T3 A_u\"] &], {{\"om1\", \"line fit of A_u'^(1)/fac0 in om2: {slope, intercept, max resid}\", \"line fit of A_u^(1)/fac0 in om2: {slope, intercept, max resid}\"}}, lnTab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"T3 u, u' independent on (2,1,1), u, u'\", {2, {-1, 8}, {2, 8}}}\n{\"T3 A_u eps^0 coefficient = 0; A_u'(0) = fac0 = a'0 c'0/2 (18 om)\", {True, True}}\n{\"om1\", \"line fit of A_u'^(1)/fac0 in om2: {slope, intercept, max resid}\", \"line fit of A_u^(1)/fac0 in om2: {slope, intercept, max resid}\"}\n{3/4, {-113/140, -431/1078, 0}, {59/70, 59/245, 0}}\n{-5/3, {-113/140, -431/1078, 0}, {59/70, 59/245, 0}}\n{7/2, {-113/140, -431/1078, 0}, {59/70, 59/245, 0}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 3, the two [5,2,1] copies (site-1 weight (2,1,1), the dim-2 weight with ONE direction at eps^0 and the second at eps^1). f(eps) := eps^4 Qnum^tk/(delta^Lambda fac0) = F0 + eps F1 + eps^2 F2 from eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 (exact 3x3 inverse), Qnum^tk = Qnum - T = R_C - T (Qnum = R_C to 1e-80, Task 2; T = delta^Lambda s <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> is itself a Q-number, identity above); g = F1/F0 fitted by a straight line in om2 (exact least squares, om1 = 3/4 and 7/2). R_c := (u.C)/(u'.C), C = [P_HW Psi_c]_((2,1,1), e1) (GT-index 2-vector), u = e1 E13, u' = e1 E12 E23 on the (2,1,1) indices (the eps^0 direction is u'), Richardson-extrapolated in eps. Signal part of the slope: slope_sig = p1' + q1' R with p1', q1' the exact om2-slopes of A_u'^(1)/fac0, A_u^(1)/fac0 (cell above); structural remainder Delta_c := slope - slope_sig. *)\nvandInv = Inverse[Table[epsL[[ie]]^j, {ie, 3}, {j, 0, 2}]];\nlineFit[xs_, ys_] := Module[{xm = Mean[xs], ym = Mean[ys], sl}, sl = Total[(xs - xm) (ys - ym)]/Total[(xs - xm)^2]; {sl, ym - sl xm, Max[Abs[ys - (ym - sl xm + sl xs)]]}];\nrich[f_] := Module[{r1 = 2 f[[1]] - f[[2]], r2 = 2 f[[2]] - f[[3]]}, {r1, r2, (4 r1 - r2)/3}];\nom5 = Flatten[Table[{o1, o2}, {o1, {3/4, 7/2}}, {o2, om2s}], 1];\nphis8 = {{1/3, -2/7, 5/11}, {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, {1/2, 1/5, -3/7}, {2/3, -1/4, 1/9}, {-1/3, 4/7, 2/5}, {3/5, 1/8, -1/6}, {1/7, -3/5, 2/3}, {5/8, -2/9, 1/4}};\nchecks[\"T3 no om component equals a phi component\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[! MemberQ[ph, o], {ph, phis8}, {o, Union[Flatten[om5]]}]];\nt5Phi[ph_, omL_: om5] := Module[{dat, out, nO = Length[omL], exSl},\n  dat = Table[Table[t3Data[ph, ie, om], {ie, 3}], {om, omL}];\n  (* exact om2-slopes of the signal pieces for this direction, om1 = 3/4 *)\n  exSl = With[{ad = Table[adecomp[ph, 3/4, o2], {o2, om2s}], f0 = Table[fac0Of[ph, {3/4, o2}], {o2, om2s}]}, {lineFitEx[om2s, Table[ad[[i, \"up\"]][[2]]/f0[[i]], {i, 6}]][[1]], lineFitEx[om2s, Table[ad[[i, \"u\"]][[2]]/f0[[i]], {i, 6}]][[1]]}];\n  out = Table[Module[{co, F0, g, fa, fb, bs, Rch, Rc, sSig},\n     co = Table[vandInv . Table[With[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, omL[[io, 1]], omL[[io, 2]]]}, epsL[[ie]]^4 dat[[io, ie, ib, \"RCtk\"]]/(deltaL[R] fac0Of[ph, omL[[io]]])], {ie, 3}], {io, nO}];\n     F0 = co[[All, 1]]; g = co[[All, 2]]/co[[All, 1]];\n     fa = lineFit[om2s, g[[1 ;; 6]]]; fb = lineFit[om2s, g[[7 ;; 12]]];\n     bs = Table[brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]], {ie, 3}];\n     Rch = Table[With[{C = PHWc[hwList[[ib, 1]]][b[\"psi\"]][[(First[idx211] - 1) d1 + 1 ;; (First[idx211] - 1) d1 + 1]]}, 0], {b, bs}];\n     Rc = rich[Table[With[{ph1 = PHWc[hwList[[ib, 1]]][b[\"psi\"]], ix = idxOf[{2, 1, 1}]}, With[{C = ph1[[(ix - 1) d1 + 1]]}, (uW . C)/(upW . C)]], {b, bs}]][[3]];\n     sSig = exSl[[1]] + exSl[[2]] Re[Rc];\n     <|\"ib\" -> ib, \"F0spread\" -> Max[Abs[F0/F0[[1]] - 1]], \"F0\" -> F0[[1]], \"slope\" -> fa[[1]], \"icpt\" -> fa[[2]], \"lineRes\" -> fa[[3]], \"dSlope\" -> fb[[1]] - fa[[1]], \"dIcpt\" -> fb[[2]] - fa[[2]], \"lineRes2\" -> fb[[3]], \"R\" -> Rc, \"slopeSig\" -> sSig, \"Delta\" -> fa[[1]] - sSig|>], {ib, {4, 5}}];\n  <|\"rows\" -> out, \"exSl\" -> exSl|>];\n{tT5a, t5one} = AbsoluteTiming[t5Phi[phiP]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time one phi (s)\", tT5a}, {\"exact om2-slopes (p1', q1') of the signal pieces at phiP\", ToString[t5one[\"exSl\"]]}}, Table[{\"copy \" <> ToString[c], ToString[Map[N[Re[#], 9] &, KeyDrop[t5one[\"rows\"][[c]], \"ib\"]]]}, {c, 2}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"time one phi (s)\", 1.3546903}\n{\"exact om2-slopes (p1', q1') of the signal pieces at phiP\", \"   113   59\\n{-(---), --}\\n   140   70\"}\n{\"copy 1\", \"                           -17                                                                                         -12                \\\n -166                -166                           -12\\n<|F0spread -> 2.15366083 10   , F0 -> -1325.40237, slope -> -1.90107066, icpt -> \\\n-0.715328282, lineRes -> 9.86022857 10   , dSlope -> 0. 10    , dIcpt -> 0. 10    , lineRes2 -> 9.86022857 10   , R -> -0.892188642, slopeSig -> \\\n-1.55913043, Delta -> -0.341940229|>\"}\n{\"copy 2\", \"                           -17                                                                                        -11                 \\\n-167                -167                           -11\\n<|F0spread -> 4.69370902 10   , F0 -> -334.331617, slope -> 0.973512900, icpt -> 0.248588427, \\\nlineRes -> 2.08490114 10   , dSlope -> 0. 10    , dIcpt -> 0. 10    , lineRes2 -> 2.08490114 10   , R -> 1.20406983, slopeSig -> 0.207715999, Delta \\\n-> 0.765796900|>\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
