   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"phi\", \"copy\", \"F0\", \"F0 spread\", \"slope\", \"intercept\", \"line resid (om1=3/4)\", \"|slope diff om1=7/2|\", \"|icpt diff|\", \"R_c = (u.C)/(u'.C)\", \n \"slope_sig\", \"Delta_c\"}\n{{1/3, -2/7, 5/11}, 1, -1325.4023665333072757875`8., ScientificForm[2.153660831289858961071`3.*^-17], -1.90107065557485288972001228031356271972`10., \n -0.71532828185804293068109472544088502003`10., ScientificForm[9.86022857485139885368041934`3.*^-12], ScientificForm[0``166.33026388798726], \n ScientificForm[0``166.37955921240916], -0.89218864158769434915233308303957139076`10., -1.55913042648105666571410931284763874364`10., \n -0.34194022909379622400590296746592397608`10.}\n{{1/3, -2/7, 5/11}, 2, -334.3316171624337036311`8., ScientificForm[4.693709017815987413697`3.*^-17], 0.97351289979037118412596837835339224017`10., \n 0.24858842706519033940843649397431942371`10., ScientificForm[2.084901135989860573541240199`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.11760447215374], \n ScientificForm[0``167.16717965973936], 1.20406982970650623038554528728267971065`10., 0.20771599932405525132495959928111575612`10., \n 0.76579690046631593280100877907227648405`10.}\n{{-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, 1, -280.1336653443929107108`8., ScientificForm[2.446984591820433151858`3.*^-17], -1.90107065557520566331550839087744261425`10., \n 1.24211339456299506860064621558884127394`10., ScientificForm[1.085097986031214824092116683`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``166.6187080396015], \n ScientificForm[0``166.66727091873037], -0.89218864158769434914427727930322470751`10., -1.55913042648105666570731942112700368204`10., \n -0.3419402290941489976081889697504389322`10.}\n{{-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, 2, -70.663478292406749271`8., ScientificForm[5.115975092644141898595`3.*^-17], 0.97351289978775585343645585221345881286`10., \n -0.26718243875181186817656521107333497284`10., ScientificForm[2.160674418544228024346532982`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.6821794001499], \n ScientificForm[0``167.7307192407712], 1.2040698297065062305328184198349683536`10., 0.20771599932405525144908981100375904089`10., \n 0.76579690046370060198736604120969977196`10.}\n{{1/2, 1/5, -3/7}, 1, -867.5880794928874137796`8., ScientificForm[5.488830959199548480189`3.*^-17], -1.90107065556499694808802634433278042809`10., \n 0.74180730323007902702473798774077161904`10., ScientificForm[2.510496390926519210793615066`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``166.26688617195296], \n ScientificForm[0``166.31531561056772], -0.89218864158769434914702026020836184493`10., -1.5591304264810566657096313621756192693`10., \n -0.3419402290839402823783949821571611588`10.}\n{{1/2, 1/5, -3/7}, 2, -218.8483535051979185896`8., ScientificForm[4.662276215598186836821`3.*^-17], 0.97351289978969263507095234223510105853`10., \n 0.44607012534224825924335860905676090142`10., ScientificForm[1.990276881880255118742939487`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.49252231996567], \n ScientificForm[0``167.5404747150329], 1.20406982970650623039408397584910003529`10., 0.20771599932405525133215649392995574403`10., \n 0.7657969004656373837387958483051453145`10.}\n{{2/3, -1/4, 1/9}, 1, 270.3552541234741345744`8., ScientificForm[2.118666002067197830552`3.*^-17], -1.90107065557452753035195673833279489207`10., \n -0.55669464722294939596031977278427261376`10., ScientificForm[8.82173054207379360685593172`3.*^-12], ScientificForm[0``167.1009542067398], \n ScientificForm[0``167.14914561475888], -0.89218864158769434915400468733246563756`10., -1.55913042648105666571551823646593532309`10., \n -0.34194022909347086463643850186685956898`10.}\n{{2/3, -1/4, 1/9}, 2, 68.1968823972145653351`8., ScientificForm[5.008037088824962944524`3.*^-17], 0.97351289978866830356317929267311244195`10., \n 0.52951408116364370796627732517473225407`10., ScientificForm[2.16616435903997789218602703`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.934763096818], \n ScientificForm[0``167.98382757062046], 1.20406982970650623043964537648294758498`10., 0.20771599932405525137055824589277010734`10., \n 0.76579690046461305219262104678034233461`10.}\n{{-1/3, 4/7, 2/5}, 1, 442.8664635693956456758`8., ScientificForm[4.301812402687928978334`3.*^-17], -1.90107065556883702768525636927056964439`10., \n 1.85949658002591604977591097203180959404`10., ScientificForm[1.939626175952818763704767221`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``166.37267001273312], \n ScientificForm[0``166.42071943356987], -0.89218864158769434918459095927952341015`10., -1.55913042648105666574129809424988401712`10., \n -0.34194022908778036194395827502068562727`10.}\n{{-1/3, 4/7, 2/5}, 2, 111.7126879284497130511`8., ScientificForm[5.179934880599418928231`3.*^-17], 0.97351289978787268023392714398142352071`10., \n -0.18527269447328389930702893247210436982`10., ScientificForm[2.224424533491813663357173737`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.31006762090598], \n ScientificForm[0``167.3585711667251], 1.20406982970650623016074647049618924124`10., 0.20771599932405525113548631084678807476`10., \n 0.76579690046381742909844083313463544596`10.}\n{{3/5, 1/8, -1/6}, 1, -903.3279332245029341727`8., ScientificForm[4.4676346420354450226`3.*^-17], -1.90107065556855355815589577974342074986`10., \n 0.5920750121933174100460098917066614891`10., ScientificForm[2.045151260030084638811959515`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``166.15875316194067], \n ScientificForm[0``166.20859040177962], -0.89218864158769434914958129598676830462`10., -1.55913042648105666571178994947456185675`10., \n -0.34194022908749689244410583026885889311`10.}\n{{3/5, 1/8, -1/6}, 2, -227.8637011437367706493`8., ScientificForm[5.18199512829655257185`3.*^-17], 0.97351289978799970767562619360276297368`10., \n 0.52508785795278963068609273134205440928`10., ScientificForm[2.239040863424655477110124205`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.26849882561245], \n ScientificForm[0``167.31835692068515], 1.20406982970650623047351246286257060159`10., 0.20771599932405525139910336155559522134`10., \n 0.76579690046394445627652283204716775233`10.}\n{{1/7, -3/5, 2/3}, 1, -124.474301890806468283`8., ScientificForm[4.132794914099197076582`3.*^-17], -1.90107065557049906076819157222815881281`10., \n -1.77265991647238472546419243982895652799`10., ScientificForm[2.23472937963345281043059641`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``167.68998600913855], \n ScientificForm[0``167.73148831909913], -0.89218864158769434907848724933254693187`10., -1.55913042648105666565186782443743241401`10., \n -0.34194022908944239511632374779072639881`10.}\n{{1/7, -3/5, 2/3}, 2, -31.3985365479370495614`8., ScientificForm[3.888069954929285522234`3.*^-17], 0.97351289979355926905274718324388303598`10., \n 0.04271640103047631843415532588232259038`10., ScientificForm[1.756734074231349771460529714`3.*^-11], ScientificForm[0``168.69474054577665], \n ScientificForm[0``168.73764587108988], 1.20406982970650623074011518843136610433`10., 0.20771599932405525162381137310643714508`10., \n 0.7657969004695040174289358101374458909`10.}\n{{5/8, -2/9, 1/4}, 1, 358.5532581785202701603`8., ScientificForm[1.951288661721786438834`3.*^-17], -1.90107065557461563177974607500355069474`10., \n -0.44751884754078480080532686990770322427`10., ScientificForm[8.60406883498838415267476048`3.*^-12], Scientific\n... [truncated]\n```",
