   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 3, F0 = 0 branches (leading covector order eps^1 or eps^2: [4,4,0] (1,3,0), [4,3,1] x2 (1,2,1), [4,2,2] (1,1,2), [3,3,2] (0,2,2)) and the O(eps) layer of the clean [6,1,1], [5,3,0]. Is K/S a constant over eps, om, phi? (adjoint singlet: K/S = -t/(3(t-2)) at every eps, om, phi.) For the 5 contaminated branches: K/S over 3 eps x 18 om (T3a data), spread = max |K/S / mean - 1|; over 8 phi at om A (eps = 1e-6, 2e-6); and for the clean ones the O(eps) law K/S = eps * lam (lam = (K/S)/eps: constant over om? phi?). Chain-side mixing for the dim-2 weights: C = [P_HW Psi]_((nu), e1), R_nu := C[idx2]/C[idx1] in the GT-index basis (u = unit covector on the first GT index of the weight, u' on the second), Richardson-extrapolated to eps = 0, at phi and phi'. *)\nksOf[ie_, io_, ib_] := T3a[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]/T3a[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]];\ncontIb = {6, 7, 8, 9, 10}; cleanIb = {2, 3, 4, 5};\nphiScanKS[ph_, om_] := Table[With[{t = t3Data[ph, ie, om]}, Table[t[[ib, \"K\"]]/t[[ib, \"S\"]], {ib, 2, nB}]], {ie, 2}];\n{tKS, ksPhi} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[phiScanKS[ph, {3/4, -1/5}], {ph, phis8}]];   (* [phi][eps][branch 2..10] *)\nnuOfBranch = Table[hwList[[ib, 1]] - Λ, {ib, nB}];\ncslice[ph_, ie_, ib_] := With[{b = brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]], ix = idxOf[nuOfBranch[[ib]]]}, PHWc[hwList[[ib, 1]]][b[\"psi\"]][[(ix - 1) d1 + 1]]];\nRmix[ph_, ib_] := With[{Cs = Table[cslice[ph, ie, ib], {ie, 3}]}, If[Length[Cs[[1]]] == 2, rich[Table[Cs[[ie, 2]]/Cs[[ie, 1]], {ie, 3}]][[3]], \"-\"]];\nrowKS[ib_] := Module[{all = Table[ksOf[ie, io, ib], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}], mean, phi1, phi2},\n  mean = Mean[Flatten[all]]; phi1 = ksPhi[[All, 1, ib - 1]]; phi2 = ksPhi[[All, 2, ib - 1]];\n  {hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], N[Re[mean], 10], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[Flatten[all]/mean - 1]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[phi1/phi1[[1]] - 1]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[phi2/phi2[[1]] - 1]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[phi1[[1]]/phi2[[1]] - 1], 3]], N[Re[Rmix[phiP, ib]], 10], N[Re[Rmix[phiC, ib]], 10]}];\ntabContam = Table[rowKS[ib], {ib, contIb}];\n(* clean branches: lam = (K/S)/eps *)\nlamOf[ie_, io_, ib_] := ksOf[ie, io, ib]/epsL[[ie]];\ntabClean = Table[Module[{all = Table[lamOf[ie, io, ib], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}], mean, ph1},\n  mean = Mean[Flatten[all]]; ph1 = ksPhi[[All, 1, ib - 1]]/epsL[[1]];\n  {hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], N[Re[all[[1, ioA]]], 8], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[all[[1]]/all[[1, 1]] - 1]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[all[[3]]/all[[1]] - 1]], 3]], N[Re[ph1[[1]]], 6], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[ph1/ph1[[1]] - 1]], 3]]}], {ib, cleanIb}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"CONTAMINATED: mu\", \"copy\", \"mean K/S (3 eps x 18 om)\", \"spread over eps, om\", \"spread over 8 phi (eps 1e-6)\", \"spread over 8 phi (2e-6)\", \"|K/S(1e-6)/K/S(2e-6) - 1| at phi\", \"R_nu (phi) [dim-2 weights; '-' for dim 1]\", \"R_nu (phi')\"}}, tabContam, {{\"CLEAN: mu\", \"copy\", \"lam = (K/S)/eps at om A, 1e-6\", \"spread over 18 om (1e-6)\", \"eps 4e-6 vs 1e-6, max over om\", \"lam at phi (1e-6) [8 phi list: spread next]\", \"spread over 8 phi\", \"\"}}, tabClean, {{\"time (s)\", tKS, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
