   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"CONTAMINATED: mu\", \"copy\", \"mean K/S (3 eps x 18 om)\", \"spread over eps, om\", \"spread over 8 phi (eps 1e-6)\", \"spread over 8 phi (2e-6)\", \n \"|K/S(1e-6)/K/S(2e-6) - 1| at phi\", \"R_nu (phi) [dim-2 weights; '-' for dim 1]\", \"R_nu (phi')\"}\n{{4, 4, 0}, 1, 0.38571446838622137122554883629779125601`10., ScientificForm[8.4829522175083`3.*^-6], ScientificForm[3.128852983178`3.*^-7], \n ScientificForm[6.257702182152`3.*^-7], ScientificForm[2.0675683946494085181535141248009`3.*^-7], Re[\"-\"], Re[\"-\"]}\n{{4, 3, 1}, 1, 0.41057064455625726582541237208279964558`10., ScientificForm[0.0000216443716558464`3.], ScientificForm[2.717544704223`3.*^-7], \n ScientificForm[5.435060156156`3.*^-7], ScientificForm[7.564493268428`3.*^-7], -0.07896576253465065109115036607995448842`10., \n -0.07896576253465065108337924082784983562`10.}\n{{4, 3, 1}, 2, -0.01328739879859317205481538413877129161`10., ScientificForm[0.000732374603755286`3.], ScientificForm[0.0000216264221767862`3.], \n ScientificForm[0.0000432515657208667`3.], ScientificForm[0.0000288625869954499`3.], -8.767188083619195311`10., -8.7671880836191955639`10.}\n{{4, 2, 2}, 1, 0.36610195069374432467727386384891710841`10., ScientificForm[0.0000177761906961789`3.], ScientificForm[1.9846117373621`3.*^-6], \n ScientificForm[3.9692189203864`3.*^-6], ScientificForm[3.074875664278`3.*^-7], -0.33333333333333333333333333333333333333`10., \n -0.33333333333333333333333333333333333333`10.}\n{{3, 3, 2}, 1, 3.65079629929451487816219334980871735752`10., ScientificForm[0.0000176557047523978`3.], ScientificForm[6.604367929691`3.*^-7], \n ScientificForm[1.3208736855292`3.*^-6], ScientificForm[8.612409608613`3.*^-7], Re[\"-\"], Re[\"-\"]}\n{\"CLEAN: mu\", \"copy\", \"lam = (K/S)/eps at om A, 1e-6\", \"spread over 18 om (1e-6)\", \"eps 4e-6 vs 1e-6, max over om\", \n \"lam at phi (1e-6) [8 phi list: spread next]\", \"spread over 8 phi\", \"\"}\n{{6, 1, 1}, 1, 0.1097031447282051673`8., ScientificForm[7.7351598173515981735`3.], ScientificForm[2.532477660793`3.*^-7], 0.1097031447282051673`6., \n ScientificForm[1.4811633383315562021`3.]}\n{{5, 3, 0}, 1, -0.00789115543504996388744258023861727695`8., ScientificForm[31.8620077213973507521`3.], ScientificForm[6.2900289461022`3.*^-6], \n -0.0078911554350499639`6., ScientificForm[6.8965431936023316797`3.]}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 1, 0.0776060112837034631`8., ScientificForm[9.6934294071045262279`3.], ScientificForm[2.7728862535456`3.*^-6], 0.0776060112837034631`6., \n ScientificForm[2.388559174877300706`3.]}\n{{5, 2, 1}, 2, -0.1584025004331959209`8., ScientificForm[10.6359297706580523196`3.], ScientificForm[7.5748649983503`3.*^-6], \n -0.1584025004331959209`6., ScientificForm[1.6999622977578717862`3.]}\n{\"time (s)\", 0.5101449, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}\n```",
