  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### [3,1,0] point A untwist result (2026-10-10)\n\n1. **Regression** (finite twist, 225 states, 200 digits): det identity 1.3e-179, exact undo on the 10 HW kets. K13 = -189/704 (the notes' +189/704 is a sign typo).\n2. **Task 0**: phi_A(0)/delta^Lambda = e1 (1 + a'0/2 E12) e^{c'0 E23}. Weights at eps^0: (3,1,0), (3,0,1), (2,2,0), (2,0,2), one direction of (2,1,1); at eps^1: (1,3,0), one direction each of (1,2,1), (1,1,2), the second direction of (2,1,1); at eps^2: the second directions of (1,2,1), (1,1,2), (0,2,2), (1,0,3), (0,3,1).\n3. **Task 1**: clean (K/S ~ eps): [6,2,0] (K = 0), [6,1,1], [5,3,0], [5,2,1] x2; contaminated (K/S = O(1) constant): [4,4,0] (27/70), [4,3,1] x2 (0.4106, -0.0133), [4,2,2] (108/295), [3,3,2] (3.6508).\n4. **Task 2**: R_C/R_Q state-independent to 2.5e-82 (10 branches x 18 om), 6.4e-77 over all 56 HW-sector states; clean branches recovered from the det6 x det2 formula with O(eps) errors (<= 1.7e-5 at 4e-6) and Richardson limits agreeing to <= 1.2e-19.\n5. **Task 3**: the (2,1,1) layer of the [5,2,1] pair is structural (F0 om-independent, F1/F0 an om2-line, om1-independent, phi-independent slope, Delta_c = -0.34194022909, 0.76579690047); the F0 = 0 branches have constant K/S (eps, om, phi).\n\nSee the result cells after each task for the tables.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# ROUND 2 (2026-10-10)\n\nThe kernel was cleared by another agent; setup cells 1-6 and the helper cells (10, 20, 21, 23, 24, 30-32) were re-run first. Round-2 cells below: Task A (t-scan machinery, fits, closed forms), Task B, Task C.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task A. Closed forms of the O(eps) constants by a t-scan (h = 1, theta = (t,0))",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ROUND 2, Task A machinery. setPoint changes (h, theta) and purges EVERY memoized definition that depends on them (literal symbols, purge[] of the cell 'statesCore/branchesAt'); y0, th12, t12, th1 are the globals the dressing/regime formulas read. Per t (h = 1, theta = (t,0), phi = phiP, om1 = 3/4, the six om2, eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6, three-eps Richardson): (a) kappa = R_C/S for the F0 = 0 branches, exact untwisted t1, t2 at theta1 + h on HW_[4,3,1], HW_[5,2,1] (2x2 matrices M, exact rationals; the copy eigenvalues tau_c = eig(M2)/h^4), numeric copy eigenvalues from the branches' own t polynomials (Richardson); (b) the [5,2,1] pair from the Q numbers (Qnum - Tq): slope, F0, line residual; chain R_c; exact signal slopes p1', q1'. *)\nsetPoint[hh_, ths_] := (hN = hh; thN = ths; th12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]]; t12 = th12/hN; y0 = (th12 - hN)/(th12 - 2 hN); th1 = thN[[1]]; purge[]);\ntOp[a_, u0_] := Sum[Sum[u0^(j - 1) tBasisC[a, I][[j]], {j, 7}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nmatHW[op_, mu_] := With[{H = hwH[mu]}, Inverse[Transpose[H] . (gd2 H)] . (Transpose[H] . (gd2 Normal[op . H]))];\nhwComm[op_, mu_] := With[{H = hwH[mu], M = matHW[op, mu]}, Normal[op . H] == H . M];\nqtk[ph_, ie_, om_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, om[[1]], om[[2]]], B, zz, sts, vq, vq2, rq, rt, V, x0, topFac, v2, v2v2, topOv, qn, Tq},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; sts = Table[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], {ib, nB}];\n  vq = vacQs[R[\"w\"]]; rq = Table[rQ[st, vq, R[\"y\"]], {st, sts}];\n  V = vecsAt[R]; x0 = x0Of[N[zz, pr]]; topFac = (V[\"v12\"] . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12); qn = rq/rq[[1]] topFac;\n  v2 = vA2[zz, R[\"w1\"], R[\"w2\"]]; v2v2 = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v2, v2]], pr]; topOv = (v2v2 . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12);\n  vq2 = vacQs[{R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"], 1 + R[\"eps\"] 5/13}]; rt = Table[det6[st, vq2[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st], {st, sts}];\n  Tq = deltaL[R] v2[[1]] rt/rt[[1]] topOv;\n  <|\"qn\" -> qn, \"Tq\" -> Tq|>];\nom6 = Table[{3/4, o2}, {o2, om2s}];\n(* Q-side F = eps^p (Qnum - Tq)/(delta^Lambda fac) for branch ib; returns {F0, F1, F2} per om *)\nFcoef[ph_, ib_, p_, facF_, omL_] := Table[vandInv . Table[With[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, om[[1]], om[[2]]]}, epsL[[ie]]^p With[{d = qtk[ph, ie, om]}, d[\"qn\"][[ib]] - d[\"Tq\"][[ib]]]/(deltaL[R] facF[ph, om])], {ie, 3}], {om, omL}];\npair521[ph_] := Module[{co, bs, ad, f0s, exSl, out},\n  ad = Table[adecomp[ph, 3/4, o2], {o2, om2s}]; f0s = Table[fac0Of[ph, {3/4, o2}], {o2, om2s}];\n  exSl = {lineFitEx[om2s, Table[ad[[i, \"up\"]][[2]]/f0s[[i]], {i, 6}]][[1]], lineFitEx[om2s, Table[ad[[i, \"u\"]][[2]]/f0s[[i]], {i, 6}]][[1]]};\n  Table[Module[{cf = Fcoef[ph, ib, 4, fac0Of, om6], F0, g, fl, Rc, bsx},\n    F0 = cf[[All, 1]]; g = cf[[All, 2]]/cf[[All, 1]]; fl = lineFit[om2s, g];\n    bsx = Table[brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]], {ie, 3}];\n    Rc = Re[rich[Table[With[{C = PHWc[hwList[[ib, 1]]][b[\"psi\"]][[(idxOf[{2, 1, 1}] - 1) d1 + 1]]}, (uW . C)/(upW . C)], {b, bsx}]][[3]]];\n    <|\"F0\" -> Re[F0[[1]]], \"F0spread\" -> Max[Abs[F0/F0[[1]] - 1]], \"slope\" -> Re[fl[[1]]], \"icpt\" -> Re[fl[[2]]], \"lineRes\" -> fl[[3]], \"R\" -> Rc, \"p1\" -> exSl[[1]], \"q1\" -> exSl[[2]], \"tauNum\" -> Re[rich[Table[b[\"tt\"][[2]] /. u -> th1 + hN, {b, bsx}]][[3]]]/hN^4, \"t1Num\" -> Re[rich[Table[b[\"tt\"][[1]] /. u -> th1 + hN, {b, bsx}]][[3]]]/hN^4|>], {ib, {4, 5}}]];\nkappaOf[ie_, io_, ib_, B_] := Null;\nscanT[tt_] := Module[{R3, B3, kap, kapB, t2e, t1e, M2431, M1431, M2521, M1521, tau431, tau521, c431, p521, e431n, e521n, uh = th1 + hN},\n  setPoint[1, {tt, 0}]; uh = th1 + hN;\n  B3 = Table[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], {ie, 3}];\n  kap = Table[rich[Table[With[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], pt = t1Point[B3[[ie]], reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5]]}, pt[[ib, \"RC\"]]/pt[[ib, \"S\"]]], {ie, 3}]][[3]], {ib, 6, 10}];\n  kapB = Table[rich[Table[With[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 7/2, -7/4], pt = t1Point[B3[[ie]], reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 7/2, -7/4]]}, pt[[ib, \"RC\"]]/pt[[ib, \"S\"]]], {ie, 3}]][[3]], {ib, 6, 10}];\n  t2e = tOp[2, uh]; t1e = tOp[1, uh];\n  M2431 = matHW[t2e, {4, 3, 1}]; M1431 = matHW[t1e, {4, 3, 1}]; M2521 = matHW[t2e, {5, 2, 1}]; M1521 = matHW[t1e, {5, 2, 1}];\n  p521 = pair521[phiP];\n  tau431 = Table[Re[rich[Table[brOf[B3[[ie]], {4, 3, 1}, c][\"tt\"][[2]] /. u -> uh, {ie, 3}]][[3]]]/hN^4, {c, 2}];\n  e431n = Table[Re[rich[Table[brOf[B3[[ie]], {4, 3, 1}, c][\"tt\"][[1]] /. u -> uh, {ie, 3}]][[3]]]/hN^4, {c, 2}];\n  <|\"t\" -> tt, \"kap\" -> Re[kap], \"kapB\" -> Re[kapB], \"M2431\" -> M2431, \"M1431\" -> M1431, \"M2521\" -> M2521, \"M1521\" -> M1521, \"comm\" -> {hwComm[t2e, {4, 3, 1}], hwComm[t1e, {4, 3, 1}], hwComm[t2e, {5, 2, 1}]}, \"tau431\" -> tau431, \"t1_431\" -> e431n, \"p521\" -> p521|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\nNull\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ROUND 2, Task A analysis: fits of the t-scan. fit set = 14 points, held-out = 6 (indices 3,6,9,12,15,18 of the 20-point list). Rational fits P/Q by the null vector of the linear system P(t) - f Q(t) = 0 (40-digit arithmetic); Q normalized to leading coefficient 1; reported with the held-out max relative error. *)\ntestIx = {3, 6, 9, 12, 15, 18}; fitIx = Complement[Range[20], testIx];\ntsAll = N[tList20, 40];\nratFit[ixs_, fs_, dn_, dd_] := Module[{ts = tsAll[[ixs]], A, sv, vv, p, q, qt},\n  A = Table[Join[Table[ts[[k]]^i, {i, 0, dn}], Table[-fs[[k]] ts[[k]]^j, {j, 0, dd}]], {k, Length[ts]}];\n  sv = SingularValueDecomposition[A]; vv = sv[[3]][[All, -1]];\n  p = vv[[1 ;; dn + 1]]; q = vv[[dn + 2 ;;]]; qt = q[[Last[Flatten[Position[Abs[q], _?(# > 10^-25 &)]]]]]; {p/qt, q/qt, Min[Diagonal[sv[[2]]]]/Max[Diagonal[sv[[2]]]]}];\nevalRat[{p_, q_, _}, t_] := Sum[p[[i + 1]] t^i, {i, 0, Length[p] - 1}]/Sum[q[[j + 1]] t^j, {j, 0, Length[q] - 1}];\nbestFit[fs_, maxDeg_: 4] := Module[{res = {}, found = None, pr0, err, fitErr},\n  Do[Do[With[{dd = tot - dn}, If[found === None && dn <= maxDeg && dd <= maxDeg && dn + dd + 2 <= 12, pr0 = ratFit[fitIx, fs[[fitIx]], dn, dd]; err = Max[Abs[Table[evalRat[pr0, tsAll[[k]]]/fs[[k]] - 1, {k, testIx}]]]; fitErr = Max[Abs[Table[evalRat[pr0, tsAll[[k]]]/fs[[k]] - 1, {k, fitIx}]]]; AppendTo[res, {dn, dd, N[fitErr, 3], N[err, 3]}]; If[err < 10^-7 && fitErr < 10^-7, found = {dn, dd, pr0}]]], {dn, 0, tot}], {tot, 0, 2 maxDeg}];\n  <|\"found\" -> found, \"tried\" -> res|>];\nshowFit[name_, fs_, maxDeg_: 4] := Module[{r = bestFit[fs, maxDeg]}, If[r[\"found\"] === None, {name, \"NO FIT up to degree \" <> ToString[maxDeg], Take[SortBy[r[\"tried\"], #[[4]] &], UpTo[3]]}, {name, \"(deg num, deg den) = \" <> ToString[r[\"found\"][[{1, 2}]]], \"held-out max rel err \" <> ToString[Last[r[\"tried\"]][[4]]], \"num coeffs \" <> ToString[N[r[\"found\"][[3, 1]], 12]], \"den coeffs \" <> ToString[N[r[\"found\"][[3, 2]], 12]]}]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\nNull\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A (a): kappa = R_C/S (Richardson) of the F0 = 0 branches over the 20 t (h = 1, theta = (t,0)); P1 sanity (t = 62/35 reproduces round 1); multiplicity-1 branches [4,4,0], [4,2,2], [3,3,2] as rational functions of t; [4,3,1] copies: kappa_c = A(t) + B(t) tau_c, tau_c = eigenvalue of the exact untwisted t2(theta1+h) on HW_[4,3,1] (h = 1), copies sorted by tau (a = larger tau). *)\nkapAll = tScanA[[All, \"kap\"]];\ntracePoly = Table[Tr[tScanA[[k, \"M2431\"]]], {k, 20}]; detPoly = Table[Det[tScanA[[k, \"M2431\"]]], {k, 20}];\ntrPolyExpr = Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{tList20[[fitIx]], tracePoly[[fitIx]]}], tt]]; detPolyExpr = Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{tList20[[fitIx]], detPoly[[fitIx]]}], tt]];\ntrHeld = Max[Abs[Table[trPolyExpr /. tt -> tList20[[k]], {k, testIx}] - tracePoly[[testIx]]]]; detHeld = Max[Abs[Table[detPolyExpr /. tt -> tList20[[k]], {k, testIx}] - detPoly[[testIx]]]];\ntau431n = Table[Sort[N[Eigenvalues[tScanA[[k, \"M2431\"]]], 40], Greater], {k, 20}];\ntauNumSorted = Table[Sort[tScanA[[k, \"tau431\"]], Greater], {k, 20}];\nchecks[\"TA exact tau431 (eigs of M2) vs branch numerics: max rel diff\"] = Max[Abs[tau431n/tauNumSorted - 1]];\nperm = Table[If[tScanA[[k, \"tau431\"]][[1]] > tScanA[[k, \"tau431\"]][[2]], {1, 2}, {2, 1}], {k, 20}];\nkapA = Table[kapAll[[k, 1 + perm[[k, 1]]]], {k, 20}]; kapB2 = Table[kapAll[[k, 1 + perm[[k, 2]]]], {k, 20}];\nBco = (kapA - kapB2)/(tau431n[[All, 1]] - tau431n[[All, 2]]); Aco = kapA - Bco tau431n[[All, 1]];\nrows = {\n  showFit[\"kappa[4,4,0]\", Table[kapAll[[k, 1]], {k, 20}]],\n  showFit[\"kappa[4,2,2]\", Table[kapAll[[k, 4]], {k, 20}]],\n  showFit[\"kappa[3,3,2]\", Table[kapAll[[k, 5]], {k, 20}]],\n  showFit[\"kappa_a + kappa_b ([4,3,1])\", kapA + kapB2],\n  showFit[\"kappa_a kappa_b ([4,3,1])\", kapA kapB2],\n  showFit[\"A(t) in kappa_c = A + B tau_c\", Aco],\n  showFit[\"B(t) in kappa_c = A + B tau_c\", Bco]};\nchecks[\"TA guess kappa[4,4,0] = (t+1)/2: max abs dev over 20 t\"] = Max[Abs[Table[kapAll[[k, 1]] - (tList20[[k]] + 1)/2, {k, 20}]]];\nchecks[\"TA P1 sanity (t = 62/35 at h = 1 vs round 1: kappa list)\"] = N[tScanTest[\"kap\"], 12];\nGrid[Join[{{\"tr M2 on HW_[4,3,1] (polynomial in t, fit on 14, exact)\", trPolyExpr, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[N[trHeld, 3]]}, {\"det M2\", detPolyExpr, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[N[detHeld, 3]]}, {\"tau431 exact vs branch numerics\", ScientificForm[checks[\"TA exact tau431 (eigs of M2) vs branch numerics: max rel diff\"], 3]}, {\"kappa[4,4,0] - (t+1)/2: max abs dev\", ScientificForm[N[checks[\"TA guess kappa[4,4,0] = (t+1)/2: max abs dev over 20 t\"], 3]]}, {\"P1 sanity kappa\", ToString[checks[\"TA P1 sanity (t = 62/35 at h = 1 vs round 1: kappa list)\"]]}}, rows], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"tr M2 on HW_[4,3,1] (polynomial in t, fit on 14, exact)\", -8 + 16*tt + 8*tt^2, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[0]}\n{\"det M2\", -64*tt - 16*tt^2 + 64*tt^3 + 16*tt^4, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[0]}\n{\"tau431 exact vs branch numerics\", ScientificForm[8.950924918804485240979076209105218064064`21.951867914240903*^-19, 3]}\n{\"kappa[4,4,0] - (t+1)/2: max abs dev\", ScientificForm[2.56584038705510670761`3.*^-18]}\n{\"P1 sanity kappa\", \"{1.38571428571, 1.41056992897, 0.986713486168, 1.36610169492, 4.65080357143}\"}\n{\"kappa[4,4,0]\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 0}\", \"held-out max rel err        -19\\n4.59 10\", \"num coeffs {0.500000000000, 0.500000000000}\", \n \"den coeffs {1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"kappa[4,2,2]\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 2}\", \"held-out max rel err        -17\\n5.39 10\", \n \"num coeffs {4.82222222220, -3.77777777777, 0.733333333333}\", \"den coeffs {5.44444444442, -4.66666666666, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"kappa[3,3,2]\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -18\\n8.78 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-1.22500000000, -0.750000000000, 0.475000000000}\", \"den coeffs {-2.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"kappa_a + kappa_b ([4,3,1])\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -13\\n2.50 10\", \n \"num coeffs {11.5555555564, -21.7777777881, -6.22222221947, 4.00000000019}\", \n \"den coeffs {4.99999999745, -17.0000000031, 3.00000000150, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"kappa_a kappa_b ([4,3,1])\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -12\\n2.80 10\", \n \"num coeffs {5.37037037461, -4.40740741718, -7.59259259123, 2.18518518542}\", \n \"den coeffs {4.99999999589, -17.0000000052, 3.00000000252, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"A(t) in kappa_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {4, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -12\\n2.16 10\", \n \"num coeffs                                                 -8\\n{8.33333334814, -18.4444446006, 7.12128066391 10  , 2.88888887856, -0.777777778490}\"\\\n, \"den coeffs {4.99999995840, -17.0000000707, 3.00000003234, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"B(t) in kappa_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -13\\n4.15 10\", \n \"num coeffs {0.638888888885, -0.611111111107, 0.194444444443}\", \"den coeffs {4.99999999976, -16.9999999996, 2.99999999990, 1.00000000000}\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A (b): the [5,2,1] pair over the 20 t. Per copy (sorted by tau = eig of the exact untwisted t2(theta1+h) on HW_[5,2,1], h = 1): slope (Q side, 3-eps), R (chain, Richardson), exact signal slopes p1', q1' (om2-slopes of A_u'^(1)/fac0, A_u^(1)/fac0), Delta = slope - p1' - q1' R (my structural remainder), Delta' = slope + (t-2) R (the adjoint combination, for comparison). Fits: Delta_c = A + B tau_c, Delta_1 + Delta_2, Delta_1 Delta_2, p1'(t), q1'(t), R_a + R_b, R_a R_b. Also the exact tr/det of t2 and t1 on HW_[5,2,1]. *)\ntau521n = Table[Sort[N[Eigenvalues[tScanA[[k, \"M2521\"]]], 40], Greater], {k, 20}];\np5 = tScanA[[All, \"p521\"]];\ncpOrd = Table[If[p5[[k, 1, \"tauNum\"]] > p5[[k, 2, \"tauNum\"]], {1, 2}, {2, 1}], {k, 20}];\ngetp[key_] := Table[{p5[[k, cpOrd[[k, 1]], key]], p5[[k, cpOrd[[k, 2]], key]]}, {k, 20}];\nslp = getp[\"slope\"]; Rr = getp[\"R\"]; p1r = p5[[All, 1, \"p1\"]]; q1r = p5[[All, 1, \"q1\"]];\nDm = Table[slp[[k, c]] - p1r[[k]] - q1r[[k]] Rr[[k, c]], {k, 20}, {c, 2}];\nDc = Table[slp[[k, c]] + (tList20[[k]] - 2) Rr[[k, c]], {k, 20}, {c, 2}];\nchecks[\"TA521 exact tau vs branch numerics: max rel diff\"] = Max[Abs[tau521n/Table[Sort[{p5[[k, 1, \"tauNum\"]], p5[[k, 2, \"tauNum\"]]}, Greater], {k, 20}] - 1]];\nchecks[\"TA521 max F0 spread, max line residual (over 20 t, both copies)\"] = {Max[Table[p5[[k, c, \"F0spread\"]], {k, 20}, {c, 2}]], Max[Table[p5[[k, c, \"lineRes\"]], {k, 20}, {c, 2}]]};\ntrE = Table[Tr[tScanA[[k, \"M2521\"]]], {k, 20}]; deE = Table[Det[tScanA[[k, \"M2521\"]]], {k, 20}];\ntrP = Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{tList20[[fitIx]], trE[[fitIx]]}], tt]]; deP = Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{tList20[[fitIx]], deE[[fitIx]]}], tt]];\ntrHeld = Max[Abs[Table[trP /. tt -> tList20[[k]], {k, testIx}] - trE[[testIx]]]]; deHeld = Max[Abs[Table[deP /. tt -> tList20[[k]], {k, testIx}] - deE[[testIx]]]];\naffine[v_] := Module[{B = (v[[All, 1]] - v[[All, 2]])/(tau521n[[All, 1]] - tau521n[[All, 2]])}, {v[[All, 1]] - B tau521n[[All, 1]], B}];\n{AD, BD} = affine[Dm]; {ADc, BDc} = affine[Dc]; {AR, BR} = affine[Rr];\nrows = {\n showFit[\"p1'(t) (exact om2-slope of A_u'^(1)/fac0)\", p1r], showFit[\"q1'(t) (exact om2-slope of A_u^(1)/fac0)\", q1r],\n showFit[\"Delta_1 + Delta_2 (Delta = slope - p1' - q1' R)\", Total[Dm, {2}]], showFit[\"Delta_1 Delta_2\", Dm[[All, 1]] Dm[[All, 2]]],\n showFit[\"A(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", AD], showFit[\"B(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", BD],\n showFit[\"Delta'_1 + Delta'_2 (Delta' = slope + (t-2) R)\", Total[Dc, {2}]], showFit[\"A(t) in Delta'_c = A + B tau_c\", ADc], showFit[\"B(t) in Delta'_c = A + B tau_c\", BDc],\n showFit[\"R_a + R_b\", Total[Rr, {2}]], showFit[\"R_a R_b\", Rr[[All, 1]] Rr[[All, 2]]], showFit[\"A(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", AR], showFit[\"B(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", BR]};\nGrid[Join[{{\"tr M2 on HW_[5,2,1]\", trP, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[N[trHeld, 3]]}, {\"det M2 on HW_[5,2,1]\", deP, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[N[deHeld, 3]]}, {\"tau521 exact vs numerics\", ScientificForm[checks[\"TA521 exact tau vs branch numerics: max rel diff\"], 3]}, {\"max F0 spread, max line resid\", ToString[N[checks[\"TA521 max F0 spread, max line residual (over 20 t, both copies)\"], 3]]}, {\"t = 62/35 sanity: Delta, Delta' (copies sorted by tau desc)\", ToString[N[{Dm[[1]], Dc[[1]]}, 8]]}}, rows], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
