  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"tr M2 on HW_[5,2,1]\", -8 + 19*tt + 8*tt^2, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[0]}\n{\"det M2 on HW_[5,2,1]\", -48 - 76*tt + 32*tt^2 + 76*tt^3 + 16*tt^4, \"held-out\", ScientificForm[0]}\n{\"tau521 exact vs numerics\", ScientificForm[9.234932745601419338759374117626050808188`21.965433736991148*^-19, 3]}\n{\"max F0 spread, max line resid\", \"        -15         -9\\n{3.01 10   , 1.32 10  }\"}\n{\"t = 62/35 sanity: Delta, Delta' (copies sorted by tau desc)\", \"{{0.71618427, -0.57000985}, {0.57719571, -1.8534932}}\"}\n{\"p1'(t) (exact om2-slope of A_u'^(1)/fac0)\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 0}\", \"held-out max rel err      -38\\n0. 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-1.25000000000, 0.250000000000}\", \"den coeffs {1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"q1'(t) (exact om2-slope of A_u^(1)/fac0)\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{1, 0, Indeterminate, 0``38.31202537996544}, \n  {1, 1, Indeterminate, 0``38.31202537996544}, {2, 1, Indeterminate, 0``38.252527562467904}}}\n{\"Delta_1 + Delta_2 (Delta = slope - p1' - q1' R)\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -11\\n5.64 10\", \n \"num coeffs {9.44761916171, 1.36190472038, -3.00000000748}\", \"den coeffs {4.00000004037, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"Delta_1 Delta_2\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -9\\n1.50 10\", \n \"num coeffs {5.33333314479, 1.14285723433, -4.58095233683, 0.990476175738}\", \"den coeffs {3.99999988574, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"A(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 0}\", \"held-out max rel err        -9\\n1.83 10\", \n \"num coeffs {1.05714284937, 0.419047626702, -0.876190478060}\", \"den coeffs {1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"B(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -10\\n2.24 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-0.123809523995, 0.219047620255}\", \"den coeffs {4.00000004266, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"Delta'_1 + Delta'_2 (Delta' = slope + (t-2) R)\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -11\\n9.47 10\", \n \"num coeffs {11.4476189123, -8.38809511812, -0.750000007476}\", \"den coeffs {3.99999994617, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"A(t) in Delta'_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 0}\", \"held-out max rel err        -10\\n2.29 10\", \n \"num coeffs {2.05714284937, -3.08095237330, 0.123809521940}\", \"den coeffs {1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"B(t) in Delta'_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -10\\n1.51 10\", \n \"num coeffs {0.626190468421, -0.0309523797449}\", \"den coeffs {3.99999994312, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"R_a + R_b\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -19\\n9.93 10\", \"num coeffs {8.00000000000, -3.50000000000}\", \n \"den coeffs {4.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"R_a R_b\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -19\\n3.95 10\", \n \"num coeffs                   -17\\n{-4.02230243214 10   , -3.50000000000}\", \"den coeffs {4.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"A(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 0}\", \"held-out max rel err        -19\\n6.41 10\", \n \"num coeffs {1.50000000000, -2.00000000000}\", \"den coeffs {1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"B(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {0, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err        -19\\n5.22 10\", \"num coeffs {0.500000000000}\", \n \"den coeffs {4.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
