  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A: rationalized closed forms (h = 1; with general h the taus scale as tau = eig(t2(theta1+h))/h^4 and t = theta12/h) checked on all 20 points; fit set (14) and held-out (6) residuals separately. *)\ncf = <|\n \"kappa440\" -> Function[t, (t + 1)/2],\n \"kappa422\" -> Function[t, (11 t - 31)/(5 (3 t - 7))],\n \"kappa332\" -> Function[t, (t + 1) (19 t - 49)/(40 (t - 2))]|>;\nD431[t_] := t^3 + 3 t^2 - 17 t + 5;\nA431[t_] := (-7 t^4 + 26 t^3 - 166 t + 75)/(9 D431[t]); B431[t_] := (7 t^2 - 22 t + 23)/(36 D431[t]);\nDlt[t_, tau_] := (111 + 44 t - 92 t^2)/105 + (23 t - 13)/(105 (t + 4)) tau;\nDltp[t_, tau_] := (216 - 647 t/2 + 13 t^2)/105 + (263 - 13 t)/(420 (t + 4)) tau;\nRc521[t_, tau_] := 3/2 - 2 t + tau/(2 (t + 4));\nres = {\n {\"kappa[4,4,0] = (t+1)/2\", Table[kapAll[[k, 1]] - cf[\"kappa440\"][tList20[[k]]], {k, 20}]},\n {\"kappa[4,2,2] = (11t-31)/(5(3t-7)) (POLE at t = 7/3, where the chain value is -2.5e6 ~ 1/eps-regulated; that point is skipped here)\", Table[If[tList20[[k]] == 7/3, 0, kapAll[[k, 4]] - cf[\"kappa422\"][tList20[[k]]]], {k, 20}]},\n {\"kappa[3,3,2] = (t+1)(19t-49)/(40(t-2))\", Table[kapAll[[k, 5]] - cf[\"kappa332\"][tList20[[k]]], {k, 20}]},\n {\"kappa_c[4,3,1] = A + B tau_c, A = (-7t^4+26t^3-166t+75)/(9D), B = (7t^2-22t+23)/(36D), D = t^3+3t^2-17t+5 (both copies)\", Flatten[Table[{kapA[[k]] - (A431[tList20[[k]]] + B431[tList20[[k]]] tau431n[[k, 1]]), kapB2[[k]] - (A431[tList20[[k]]] + B431[tList20[[k]]] tau431n[[k, 2]])}, {k, 20}]]},\n {\"R_c[5,2,1] = 3/2 - 2t + tau_c/(2(t+4)) (both copies)\", Flatten[Table[Rr[[k, c]] - Rc521[tList20[[k]], tau521n[[k, c]]], {k, 20}, {c, 2}]]},\n {\"slope_c = p1' + q1' R_c + Delta_c, p1' = (t-5)/4, q1' = (7-3t)/2, Delta_c = (111+44t-92t^2)/105 + (23t-13)/(105(t+4)) tau_c\", Flatten[Table[slp[[k, c]] - ((tList20[[k]] - 5)/4 + (7 - 3 tList20[[k]])/2 Rr[[k, c]] + Dlt[tList20[[k]], tau521n[[k, c]]]), {k, 20}, {c, 2}]]},\n {\"Delta'_c = slope + (t-2) R = (216-647t/2+13t^2)/105 + (263-13t)/(420(t+4)) tau_c\", Flatten[Table[Dc[[k, c]] - Dltp[tList20[[k]], tau521n[[k, c]]], {k, 20}, {c, 2}]]}};\nixPairs[ix_] := Flatten[Table[{2 k - 1, 2 k}, {k, ix}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"closed form (h = 1)\", \"max abs resid fit set (14 t)\", \"held-out (6 t)\"}}, Table[{r[[1]], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[If[Length[r[[2]]] == 20, r[[2, fitIx]], r[[2, ixPairs[fitIx]]]]]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[If[Length[r[[2]]] == 20, r[[2, testIx]], r[[2, ixPairs[testIx]]]]]], 3]]}, {r, res}], {{\"tr/det t2 on HW_[4,3,1]: tr = 8t^2+16t-8, det = 16 t (t-1)(t+1)(t+4)\", \"exact\", \"exact\"}, {\"tr/det t2 on HW_[5,2,1]: tr = 8t^2+19t-8, det = 4 (t+4)(t-1)(t+1)(4t+3)\", \"exact\", \"exact\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"closed form (h = 1)\", \"max abs resid fit set (14 t)\", \"held-out (6 t)\"}\n{\"kappa[4,4,0] = (t+1)/2\", ScientificForm[1.37266467211326385055`3.*^-18], ScientificForm[2.56584038705510670761`3.*^-18]}\n{\"kappa[4,2,2] = (11t-31)/(5(3t-7)) (POLE at t = 7/3, where the chain value is -2.5e6 ~ 1/eps-regulated; that point is skipped here)\", \n ScientificForm[3.36981209132555186891348`3.*^-15], ScientificForm[1.936318012264724645536`3.*^-17]}\n{\"kappa[3,3,2] = (t+1)(19t-49)/(40(t-2))\", ScientificForm[7.186594812141526225065`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[4.915394683518287515316`3.*^-17]}\n{\"kappa_c[4,3,1] = A + B tau_c, A = (-7t^4+26t^3-166t+75)/(9D), B = (7t^2-22t+23)/(36D), D = t^3+3t^2-17t+5 (both copies)\", \n ScientificForm[2.9522209666605120924790717459`3.*^-10], ScientificForm[9.0999259631249734950474`3.*^-16]}\n{\"R_c[5,2,1] = 3/2 - 2t + tau_c/(2(t+4)) (both copies)\", ScientificForm[9.6710892986324873564`3.*^-19], \n ScientificForm[2.26676738899232523113`3.*^-18]}\n{\"slope_c = p1' + q1' R_c + Delta_c, p1' = (t-5)/4, q1' = (7-3t)/2, Delta_c = (111+44t-92t^2)/105 + (23t-13)/(105(t+4)) tau_c\", \n ScientificForm[7.1034146384555304886251921333`3.*^-10], ScientificForm[1.61610440617514817706558465251`3.*^-9]}\n{\"Delta'_c = slope + (t-2) R = (216-647t/2+13t^2)/105 + (263-13t)/(420(t+4)) tau_c\", ScientificForm[7.1034146374884215587619433977`3.*^-10], \n ScientificForm[1.61610440541955904740147624213`3.*^-9]}\n{\"tr/det t2 on HW_[4,3,1]: tr = 8t^2+16t-8, det = 16 t (t-1)(t+1)(t+4)\", \"exact\", \"exact\"}\n{\"tr/det t2 on HW_[5,2,1]: tr = 8t^2+19t-8, det = 4 (t+4)(t-1)(t+1)(4t+3)\", \"exact\", \"exact\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
