  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ROUND 2, Task B machinery: the eps^2 layer of the weights (1,2,1) ([4,3,1] x 2) and (1,1,2) ([4,2,2]). Exact covector: phi_nu/delta^Lambda = eps c1 + eps^2 c2 + ..., c1 = fac1(om,phi) u' (rank 1 over the grid; u' normalized so its FIRST GT component is 1, fac1 = c1[[1]]), c2 = a2 u' + b2 u with u = (0,1) the unit covector on the second GT index of the weight; mixing R := (u.C)/(u'.C) for a CG slice C (GT-index 2-vector, site 2 = e1). Four-eps Richardson (eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6, 8e-6). F = eps^p Qnum^tk/(delta^Lambda fac1), p = 4 ([4,3,1]) or 5 ([4,2,2]) = -(eps-exponent of ||Psi||) + 1 -> F = F0 + eps F1 + ... *)\nepsL4 = {10^-6, 2 10^-6, 4 10^-6, 8 10^-6};\nvandInv4 = Inverse[Table[epsL4[[ie]]^j, {ie, 4}, {j, 0, 3}]];\nom2L10 = {-1/5, 9/7, -12/5, 5/3, 2/9, -7/4, 11/3, -5/2, 3, -8/3};\nomL10 = Table[{3/4, o2}, {o2, om2L10}];\ncovC[ph_, o_, wt_] := Module[{s = serC[#, 2] & /@ phiScaledS[ph, o[[1]], o[[2]]][[idxOf[wt]]]}, {s[[All, 2]], s[[All, 3]]}];\ncovDecomp[ph_, o_, wt_, x_] := Module[{c = covC[ph, o, wt], f1, a2, b2}, f1 = c[[1, 1]]; a2 = c[[2, 1]]; b2 = c[[2, 2]] - a2 x; {f1, a2, b2, c[[1, 2]]/c[[1, 1]]}];\nqtkE[ph_, eps_, om_] := Module[{R = reg[eps, ph, om[[1]], om[[2]]], B, zz, sts, vq, vq2, rq, rt, V, x0, topFac, v2, v2v2, topOv, qn, Tq},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; sts = Table[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], {ib, nB}];\n  vq = vacQs[R[\"w\"]]; rq = Table[rQ[st, vq, R[\"y\"]], {st, sts}];\n  V = vecsAt[R]; x0 = x0Of[N[zz, pr]]; topFac = (V[\"v12\"] . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12); qn = rq/rq[[1]] topFac;\n  v2 = vA2[zz, R[\"w1\"], R[\"w2\"]]; v2v2 = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v2, v2]], pr]; topOv = (v2v2 . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12);\n  vq2 = vacQs[{R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"], 1 + R[\"eps\"] 5/13}]; rt = Table[det6[st, vq2[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st], {st, sts}];\n  Tq = deltaL[R] v2[[1]] rt/rt[[1]] topOv;\n  <|\"qn\" -> qn, \"Tq\" -> Tq|>];\n(* per-point Q data cache: key {ph, eps, om} -> association; branches' states are memoized in branchesAt *)\nqCache = <||>;\nqtkC[ph_, eps_, om_] := qtkC[ph, eps, om] = qtkE[ph, eps, om];\n(* qtkC is memoized on (phi, eps, om) only, so it MUST be purged whenever (h, theta) changes (stale-cache bug found in round 2: a t-scan reused P1/first-t Q numbers). Literal-symbol purge, added to purge[]: *)\npurge[] := (DownValues[Tm] = Select[DownValues[Tm], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[tBasisC] = Select[DownValues[tBasisC], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[tBasisN] = Select[DownValues[tBasisN], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[tZof] = Select[DownValues[tZof], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[wgt] = Select[DownValues[wgt], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[statesCore] = Select[DownValues[statesCore], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[branchesAt] = Select[DownValues[branchesAt], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[raiseSec] = Select[DownValues[raiseSec], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[qtkC] = Select[DownValues[qtkC], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &];);\npolyFit[xs_, ys_, d_] := Module[{A = Table[x^j, {x, xs}, {j, 0, d}], co}, co = LeastSquares[A, ys]; {co, Max[Abs[A . co - ys]]}];\n(* minimal exact polynomial degree through the points (exact rationals only) *)\nexactDeg[xs_, ys_] := Exponent[Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{xs, ys}], w]], w];\nlayer2[ph_, ib_, wt_, p_, omL_] := Module[{x1, dec, F, F0, g, Rch, bs, C, pf, sgn, xU, decs, s1, aOvF, bOvF, rem},\n  xU = (covC[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, wt][[1]])[[2]]/(covC[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, wt][[1]])[[1]];\n  decs = Table[covDecomp[ph, o, wt, xU], {o, omL}];\n  F = Table[vandInv4 . Table[With[{R = reg[epsL4[[ie]], ph, omL[[io, 1]], omL[[io, 2]]], d = qtkC[ph, epsL4[[ie]], omL[[io]]]}, epsL4[[ie]]^p (d[\"qn\"][[ib]] - d[\"Tq\"][[ib]])/(deltaL[R] decs[[io, 1]])], {ie, 4}], {io, Length[omL]}];\n  F0 = F[[All, 1]]; g = F[[All, 2]]/F[[All, 1]];\n  bs = Table[brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL4[[ie]], ph, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]], {ie, 4}];\n  Rch = Table[With[{Cv = PHWc[hwList[[ib, 1]]][b[\"psi\"]][[(idxOf[wt] - 1) d1 + 1]]}, Cv[[2]]/(Cv[[1]] + xU Cv[[2]])], {b, bs}];\n  (* R(eps) -> eps = 0 by 4-point Vandermonde *)\n  Rc = Re[(vandInv4 . Rch)[[1]]];\n  aOvF = decs[[All, 2]]/decs[[All, 1]]; bOvF = decs[[All, 3]]/decs[[All, 1]];\n  s1 = aOvF + bOvF Rc;\n  <|\"xU\" -> xU, \"F0\" -> Re[F0], \"g\" -> Re[g], \"R\" -> Rc, \"aOvF\" -> aOvF, \"bOvF\" -> bOvF, \"s1\" -> s1, \"fac1\" -> decs[[All, 1]], \"rem\" -> Re[g] - s1|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\nNull\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
