  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task B at P1 (h = 1/2, theta = (2/7,-3/5)), phi = phiP, om1 = 3/4, ten om2: exact covector structure and the Q-side F = F0 + eps F1. *)\nsetPoint[1/2, {2/7, -3/5}];\nlay = Association[Table[r[[1]] -> layer2[phiP, r[[2]], r[[3]], r[[4]], omL10], {r, {{\"431a\", 7, {1, 2, 1}, 4}, {\"431b\", 8, {1, 2, 1}, 4}, {\"422\", 9, {1, 1, 2}, 5}}}]];\n(* exact covector data: u' = (1, xU), u = (0,1); degrees of the exact coefficient functions in om2 *)\ndegTab = Table[{k, lay[k][\"xU\"], exactDeg[om2L10, lay[k][\"aOvF\"]], exactDeg[om2L10, lay[k][\"bOvF\"]]}, {k, {\"431a\", \"422\"}}];\nfitTab = Table[{k, Table[{d, ScientificForm[N[polyFit[om2L10, lay[k][\"g\"], d][[2]], 3]]}, {d, 0, 4}]}, {k, Keys[lay]}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"exact: weight key, xU (u' = (1,xU)), degree in om2 of a2/fac1, degree of b2/fac1 (10 pts => 9 means not a polynomial)\"}}, degTab, {{\"R (chain, 4-eps), per branch\", ToString[N[Table[lay[k][\"R\"], {k, Keys[lay]}], 12]]}, {\"F0 spread over 10 om\", ToString[Table[N[Max[Abs[lay[k][\"F0\"]/lay[k][\"F0\"][[1]] - 1]], 3], {k, Keys[lay]}]]}}, {{\"polynomial fit residual of g = F1/F0 in om2, degrees 0..4\", \"\"}}, fitTab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"exact: weight key, xU (u' = (1,xU)), degree in om2 of a2/fac1, degree of b2/fac1 (10 pts => 9 means not a polynomial)\"}\n{\"431a\", 167/86, 1, 1}\n{\"422\", 81/86, 1, 1}\n{\"R (chain, 4-eps), per branch\", \"{-0.0932674372902, 0.547106167023, -0.485875706215}\"}\n{\"F0 spread over 10 om\", \"        -21         -21         -21\\n{3.27 10   , 1.29 10   , 4.04 10   }\"}\n{\"polynomial fit residual of g = F1/F0 in om2, degrees 0..4\", \"\"}\n{\"431a\", {{0, ScientificForm[3.6933801597394695088`3.]}, {1, ScientificForm[2.99679552542872870781829`3.*^-15]}, \n  {2, ScientificForm[7.6623726017178853108456`3.*^-16]}, {3, ScientificForm[3.8759829996327368702273`3.*^-16]}, \n  {4, ScientificForm[8.02665346368736054`3.*^-21]}}}\n{\"431b\", {{0, ScientificForm[2.8858697673293828294`3.]}, {1, ScientificForm[1.47275181543932709416833`3.*^-15]}, \n  {2, ScientificForm[3.2473054787631462294737`3.*^-16]}, {3, ScientificForm[2.7110546823495497406012`3.*^-16]}, \n  {4, ScientificForm[5.15097146896759065`3.*^-21]}}}\n{\"422\", {{0, ScientificForm[0.5552438626401816905`3.]}, {1, ScientificForm[4.32099415374616884002718`3.*^-15]}, \n  {2, ScientificForm[9.84259379616531820679`3.*^-16]}, {3, ScientificForm[7.5442079224997883241923`3.*^-16]}, \n  {4, ScientificForm[1.743050988892796726`3.*^-20]}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
