  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task B at P1: structure of g = F1/F0 (F = eps^p Qnum^tk/(delta^Lambda fac1)) in om2, om1- and phi-independence. g = s1 + rem, s1 = a2/fac1 + (b2/fac1) R (the signal's known part, exact covector coefficients), rem = remainder (contamination ratio (R_C/S)_1/(R_C/S)_0 plus the om-independent eps-correction of the slice). Straight-line fits in om2 (degree 1; degrees 2-4 gave no improvement, cell above). *)\nlayKeys = {{\"431a\", 7, {1, 2, 1}, 4}, {\"431b\", 8, {1, 2, 1}, 4}, {\"422\", 9, {1, 1, 2}, 5}};\nlaySum[ph_, omL_] := Association[Table[r[[1]] -> Module[{l = layer2[ph, r[[2]], r[[3]], r[[4]], omL], o2 = omL[[All, 2]], fg, fs, fr, fa, fb},\n   fg = polyFit[o2, l[\"g\"], 1]; fs = polyFit[o2, l[\"s1\"], 1]; fr = polyFit[o2, l[\"rem\"], 1]; fa = polyFit[o2, l[\"aOvF\"], 1]; fb = polyFit[o2, l[\"bOvF\"], 1];\n   <|\"F0\" -> l[\"F0\"][[1]], \"F0spread\" -> Max[Abs[l[\"F0\"]/l[\"F0\"][[1]] - 1]], \"R\" -> l[\"R\"], \"gSlope\" -> fg[[1, 2]], \"gRes\" -> fg[[2]], \"s1Slope\" -> fs[[1, 2]], \"remSlope\" -> fr[[1, 2]], \"remIcpt\" -> fr[[1, 1]], \"remRes\" -> fr[[2]], \"aSlope\" -> fa[[1, 2]], \"bSlope\" -> fb[[1, 2]], \"xU\" -> l[\"xU\"]|>], {r, layKeys}]];\n{tL1, lsBase} = AbsoluteTiming[laySum[phiP, omL10]];\nomL10b = Table[{7/2, o2}, {o2, om2L10}];\n{tL2, lsOm1} = AbsoluteTiming[laySum[phiP, omL10b]];\n{tL3, lsPhiC} = AbsoluteTiming[laySum[phiC, omL10]];\n{tL4, lsPhi3} = AbsoluteTiming[laySum[phis8[[3]], omL10]];\n{tL5, lsPhi4} = AbsoluteTiming[laySum[phis8[[4]], omL10]];\nvars = {{\"phiP, om1 = 3/4\", lsBase}, {\"phiP, om1 = 7/2\", lsOm1}, {\"phi' , om1 = 3/4\", lsPhiC}, {\"phi3, om1 = 3/4\", lsPhi3}, {\"phi4, om1 = 3/4\", lsPhi4}};\nGrid[Join[{{\"variant\", \"branch\", \"R\", \"g slope\", \"g fit resid\", \"s1 slope (a'+b' R)\", \"rem slope\", \"rem intercept\", \"F0\", \"F0 spread\"}}, Flatten[Table[Table[{v[[1]], k, N[Re[v[[2]][k][\"R\"]], 10], N[Re[v[[2]][k][\"gSlope\"]], 10], ScientificForm[N[v[[2]][k][\"gRes\"], 3]], N[Re[v[[2]][k][\"s1Slope\"]], 10], N[Re[v[[2]][k][\"remSlope\"]], 10], N[Re[v[[2]][k][\"remIcpt\"]], 10], N[Re[v[[2]][k][\"F0\"]], 8], ScientificForm[N[v[[2]][k][\"F0spread\"], 3]]}, {k, {\"431a\", \"431b\", \"422\"}}], {v, vars}], 1], {{\"time (s)\", ToString[{tL1, tL2, tL3, tL4, tL5}], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
