   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task B driver (after the qtkC purge fix; 20 t x ~28 s; stored in tScanB): *)\nom6L = Table[{3/4, o2}, {o2, om2s}];\n{tScanBt, tScanB} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[setPoint[1, {t, 0}]; <|\"t\" -> t, \"ls\" -> laySum[phiP, om6L]|>, {t, tList20}]]; setPoint[1/2, {2/7, -3/5}];",
