  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task B t-scan analysis (h = 1, theta = (t,0), phi = phiP, om1 = 3/4, six om2, 4-eps Richardson). Quantities per branch: R (chain, eps -> 0), exact slopes aSlope, bSlope of a2/fac1, b2/fac1, xU, the remainder slope rem = (g - s1) slope. The [4,2,2] data at t = 7/3 (a pole of kappa) is excluded from its fits; copies of [4,3,1] sorted by tau (from the Task A scan, same copy labels). *)\nlsB = tScanB[[All, \"ls\"]];\nsortedCopies[k_] := If[tScanA[[k, \"tau431\"]][[1]] > tScanA[[k, \"tau431\"]][[2]], {\"431a\", \"431b\"}, {\"431b\", \"431a\"}];\ntau431s = Table[Sort[N[Eigenvalues[tScanA[[k, \"M2431\"]]], 40], Greater], {k, 20}];\nget431[key_] := Table[{lsB[[k]][sortedCopies[k][[1]]][key], lsB[[k]][sortedCopies[k][[2]]][key]}, {k, 20}];\nfitWithout[excl_, f_] := Block[{fitIx = Complement[fitIx, excl]}, f[]];\nremS = get431[\"remSlope\"]; Rm = get431[\"R\"]; gS = get431[\"gSlope\"]; aS = get431[\"aSlope\"]; bS = get431[\"bSlope\"]; xUs = lsB[[All, \"431a\", \"xU\"]];\naffine431[v_] := Module[{B = (v[[All, 1]] - v[[All, 2]])/(tau431s[[All, 1]] - tau431s[[All, 2]])}, {v[[All, 1]] - B tau431s[[All, 1]], B}];\n{ARm, BRm} = affine431[Rm]; {ADl, BDl} = affine431[remS];\nrows431 = {\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] xU(t)\", Re[xUs]],\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] aSlope_a (exact slope of a2/fac1, copy-independent?)\", Re[aS[[All, 1]]]],\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] bSlope (exact slope of b2/fac1)\", Re[bS[[All, 1]]]],\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] R_a + R_b\", Re[Total[Rm, {2}]]], showFit[\"[4,3,1] R_a R_b\", Re[Rm[[All, 1]] Rm[[All, 2]]]],\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] A(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", Re[ARm]], showFit[\"[4,3,1] B(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", Re[BRm]],\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] Delta_a + Delta_b (rem slopes)\", Re[Total[remS, {2}]]], showFit[\"[4,3,1] Delta_a Delta_b\", Re[remS[[All, 1]] remS[[All, 2]]]],\n  showFit[\"[4,3,1] A(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", Re[ADl]], showFit[\"[4,3,1] B(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", Re[BDl]]};\nex7 = {4};\nrem422 = Re[lsB[[All, \"422\", \"remSlope\"]]]; R422 = Re[lsB[[All, \"422\", \"R\"]]]; xU422 = Re[lsB[[All, \"422\", \"xU\"]]]; aS422 = Re[lsB[[All, \"422\", \"aSlope\"]]]; bS422 = Re[lsB[[All, \"422\", \"bSlope\"]]];\nrows422 = {\n  fitWithout[ex7, Function[showFit[\"[4,2,2] Delta (rem slope)\", rem422]]],\n  fitWithout[ex7, Function[showFit[\"[4,2,2] R\", R422]]],\n  fitWithout[ex7, Function[showFit[\"[4,2,2] xU\", xU422]]],\n  fitWithout[ex7, Function[showFit[\"[4,2,2] aSlope\", aS422]]],\n  fitWithout[ex7, Function[showFit[\"[4,2,2] bSlope\", bS422]]]};\nGrid[Join[{{\"fit (fit set 14 t, held-out 6; [4,2,2] without t = 7/3)\", \"degrees\", \"held-out max rel err\", \"num coeffs\", \"den coeffs\"}}, rows431, rows422, {{\"t = 7/3 values [4,2,2] (R, rem slope)\", ToString[N[{R422[[4]], rem422[[4]]}, 8]]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"fit (fit set 14 t, held-out 6; [4,2,2] without t = 7/3)\", \"degrees\", \"held-out max rel err\", \"num coeffs\", \"den coeffs\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] xU(t)\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err      -38\\n0. 10\", \"num coeffs {-1.50000000000, -0.500000000000}\", \n \"den coeffs {-3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] aSlope_a (exact slope of a2/fac1, copy-independent?)\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err      -37\\n0. 10\", \n \"num coeffs {0, 2.00000000000, -1.00000000000}\", \"den coeffs {-3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] bSlope (exact slope of b2/fac1)\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{3, 4, Indeterminate, 0``36.64048807510958}, \n  {4, 4, Indeterminate, 0``36.64048807510958}, {2, 3, Indeterminate, 0``36.60340089429664}}}\n{\"[4,3,1] R_a + R_b\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -18\\n8.76 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-8.00000000000, -13.3333333333, 13.3333333333, -2.66666666667}\", \n \"den coeffs {5.00000000000, -17.0000000000, 3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] R_a R_b\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -17\\n1.79 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-4.00000000000, 6.66666666667, -3.11111111111, 0.444444444444}\", \n \"den coeffs {5.00000000000, -17.0000000000, 3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] A(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {4, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -16\\n1.88 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-10.000000000, 9.33333333333, 4.00000000000, -4.00000000000, 0.666666666667}\", \n \"den coeffs {5.00000000000, -17.0000000000, 3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] B(t) in R_c = A + B tau_c\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {2, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -18\\n5.65 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-1.50000000000, 1.00000000000, -0.166666666667}\", \"den coeffs {5.00000000000, -17.0000000000, 3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] Delta_a + Delta_b (rem slopes)\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{4, 4, 3.061822441381`3.*^-7, 0.0013562700839340569`3.}, \n  {4, 3, 0.0000419988808671507`3., 0.0061818649430829023`3.}, {3, 4, 0.0002733865696045321`3., 0.0533254220179102676`3.}}}\n{\"[4,3,1] Delta_a Delta_b\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{4, 3, 5.1781880663834`3.*^-6, 0.031326695604324686`3.}, \n  {4, 2, 5.7641403182352`3.*^-6, 0.0421557926751527777`3.}, {4, 4, 6.394526738866`3.*^-7, 0.0565096328145501608`3.}}}\n{\"[4,3,1] A(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{3, 4, 9.248295476704`3.*^-7, 0.0023451144235991745`3.}, \n  {4, 2, 4.7292904962129`3.*^-6, 0.0029534012627083484`3.}, {4, 3, 1.5457508001027`3.*^-6, 0.0033455212460824517`3.}}}\n{\"[4,3,1] B(t) in Delta_c = A + B tau_c\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{4, 4, 1.315350462213090800581379038982`3.*^-7, 0.0029361062377384417`3.}, \n  {4, 3, 2.9779788479553`3.*^-6, 0.0067729551484447424`3.}, {3, 4, 3.0419355463387`3.*^-6, 0.0071038558809254749`3.}}}\n{\"[4,2,2] Delta (rem slope)\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 2}\", \"held-out max rel err        -11\\n1.37 10\", \n \"num coeffs {9.99595959596, -13.5757575758, 5.88282828283, -0.848484848485}\", \"den coeffs {6.57575757576, -5.15151515152, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,2,2] R\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err      -38\\n0. 10\", \"num coeffs {0.666666666667, -0.222222222222}\", \n \"den coeffs {-2.33333333333, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,2,2] xU\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err      -38\\n0. 10\", \"num coeffs {1.50000000000, -1.50000000000}\", \n \"den coeffs {-3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,2,2] aSlope\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{1, 0, 0``38.52287874528034, Indeterminate}, {1, 1, 0``38.52287874528034, Indeterminate}, \n  {1, 2, 0``38.26760624017703, Indeterminate}}}\n{\"[4,2,2] bSlope\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {1, 1}\", \"held-out max rel err      -38\\n0. 10\", \"num coeffs {-3.00000000000, 3.00000000000}\", \n \"den coeffs {-3.00000000000, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"t = 7/3 values [4,2,2] (R, rem slope)\", \n \"{Indeterminate, {Indeterminate, Indeterminate, Indeterminate, Indeterminate, Indeterminate, Indeterminate}}\"}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
