  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task B: affine-in-tau_c fit of the [4,3,1] remainder slopes, Delta_c D(t) = P(t) + Q(t) tau_c with D = t^3+3t^2-17t+5 (the common denominator of the kappa fits), polynomial P (deg dP), Q (deg dQ) by least squares on the 14 fit t (28 data), held-out 6 t (12 data). Also the same ansatz for R_c. *)\nD431[t_] := t^3 + 3 t^2 - 17 t + 5;\naffLS[vals_, dP_, dQ_] := Module[{rows, co, resFit, resTest, row},\n  row[k_, c_] := Join[Table[tsAll[[k]]^i, {i, 0, dP}], Table[tsAll[[k]]^j tau431s[[k, c]], {j, 0, dQ}]];\n  rows = Table[{row[k, c], D431[tsAll[[k]]] vals[[k, c]]}, {k, fitIx}, {c, 2}] // Flatten[#, 1] &;\n  co = LeastSquares[N[rows[[All, 1]], 40], N[rows[[All, 2]], 40]];\n  resFit = Max[Abs[rows[[All, 1]] . co - rows[[All, 2]]]]; resTest = Max[Flatten[Table[Abs[row[k, c] . co - D431[tsAll[[k]]] vals[[k, c]]], {k, testIx}, {c, 2}]]];\n  {co, resFit, resTest}];\naffTab = Flatten[Table[Table[{name, dP, dQ, With[{r = affLS[If[name == \"R_c\", Rm, remS], dP, dQ]}, {ScientificForm[N[r[[2]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[r[[3]], 3]], N[Re[r[[1]]], 10]}]}, {dP, {4, 5, 6}}, {dQ, {2, 3}}], {name, {\"R_c\", \"Delta_c\"}}], 2];\nGrid[Join[{{\"quantity\", \"deg P\", \"deg Q\", \"{max resid (D Delta - P - Q tau), fit set; held-out; coefficients}\"}}, affTab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"quantity\", \"deg P\", \"deg Q\", \"{max resid (D Delta - P - Q tau), fit set; held-out; coefficients}\"}\n{\"R_c\", 4, 2, {ScientificForm[6.654080078701598362055`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[1.0979071300778072007212`3.*^-16], \n  {-10.0000000000000045015`10., 9.3333333333333407327`10., 3.99999999999999554414591151907387711617`10., \n   -3.99999999999999883513318588157403610239`10., 0.66666666666666655493620117014086908593`10., -1.50000000000000000416422177208075017774`10., \n   1.00000000000000000343476759102469474584`10., -0.16666666666666666733712075277623165546`10.}}}\n{\"R_c\", 4, 3, {ScientificForm[6.632205393562287403865`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[1.3222849328061912441129`3.*^-16], \n  {-10.0000000000000042243`10., 9.3333333333333401011`10., 3.99999999999999603740368989135411936786`10., \n   -3.9999999999999989957577377353015180006`10., 0.6666666666666665736315153450874919289`10., -1.49999999999999999326844847840921450056`10., \n   0.99999999999999999011440455228517396418`10., -0.16666666666666666201838928070065326138`10., -6.9537288990237345359`10.*^-19}}}\n{\"R_c\", 5, 2, {ScientificForm[6.252504655196682755193`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[9.5119121193629668398019`3.*^-16], \n  {-9.9999999999999552093`10., 9.3333333333332370807`10., 4.0000000000000818569`10., -4.0000000000000344153`10., \n   0.66666666666667381632962059219547239422`10., -5.8701292404627051002154`10.*^-16, -1.50000000000000000416422177208075017774`10., \n   1.00000000000000000343476759102469474584`10., -0.16666666666666666733712075277623165546`10.}}}\n{\"R_c\", 5, 3, {ScientificForm[6.234262582328779134812`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[9.680440537202678663143`3.*^-16], \n  {-9.9999999999999551695`10., 9.3333333333332369523`10., 4.0000000000000819339`10., -4.0000000000000344081`10., \n   0.66666666666667380197851359389794185323`10., -5.8447234179151817773908`10.*^-16, -1.49999999999999999421214832930078277176`10., \n   0.99999999999999999126810188745101991857`10., -0.16666666666666666247905287582568287899`10., -6.3514556368808307062`10.*^-19}}}\n{\"R_c\", 6, 2, {ScientificForm[6.177359637785538824936`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[3.04245171024233714369106`3.*^-15], \n  {-10.000000000000192803`10., 9.3333333333338407006`10., 3.99999999999944810948971155029063595521`10., \n   -3.99999999999968242921479302798282162712`10., 0.666666666666564733574812008044411095`10., 1.729986640064711807156137`10.*^-14, \n   -1.21256728439599189284157`10.*^-15, -1.50000000000000000416422177208075017774`10., 1.00000000000000000343476759102469474584`10., \n   -0.16666666666666666733712075277623165546`10.}}}\n{\"R_c\", 6, 3, {ScientificForm[6.159117564917635204554`3.*^-17], ScientificForm[3.0593045520263083260255`3.*^-15], \n  {-10.0000000000001927632`10., 9.3333333333338405724`10., 3.99999999999944818646806579676145076974`10., \n   -3.99999999999968242195063847232994191927`10., 0.66666666666656471922370500974688055399`10., 1.730240698290187040384385`10.*^-14, \n   -1.21256728439599189284157`10.*^-15, -1.49999999999999999421214832930078277173`10., 0.99999999999999999126810188745101991853`10., \n   -0.16666666666666666247905287582568287897`10., -6.3514556368808307062`10.*^-19}}}\n{\"Delta_c\", 4, 2, {ScientificForm[7.9543427803151142666`3.], ScientificForm[1457.4252710989117920558`3.], \n  {1695.2193090498249196052`10., -3019.167589122704025877`10., 2165.6602089989475512419`10., -732.2554129791494699984`10., \n   97.1256981504494095423`10., -23.9061170216573505943`10., 21.0611784426541704455`10., -4.6898964401883666365`10.}}}\n{\"Delta_c\", 4, 3, {ScientificForm[2.3468420730087513102`3.], ScientificForm[1365.8700554254865056291`3.], \n  {3449.5271208954940292263`10., -7017.044611969248883072`10., 5287.7820521848447324753`10., -1749.0995411378881854439`10., \n   215.4643621884102184179`10., 45.0625690976420008865`10., -63.2548138832446499594`10., 28.9769128411206296924`10., -4.4016109079107159629`10.}}}\n{\"Delta_c\", 5, 2, {ScientificForm[7.8667339607260859099`3.], ScientificForm[1376.8618345174633472414`3.], \n  {-3024.4645432327447342653`10., 6905.4299382141883140397`10., -6098.7140737025518006597`10., 2674.5215431908877303821`10., \n   -598.1470155970814957064`10., 56.206026189806384522`10., -23.9061170216573505943`10., 21.0611784426541704455`10., -4.6898964401883666365`10.}}}\n{\"Delta_c\", 5, 3, {ScientificForm[1.6869312923349862411`3.], ScientificForm[1259.8683562644205407755`3.], \n  {-2748.1128862657967504623`10., 6014.8796171940665679102`10., -5564.4716763021911435963`10., 2724.9315894976402808036`10., \n   -697.7732950124204586`10., 73.842906579565444985`10., 45.1817972200796453564`10., -63.4005733289022741854`10., 29.0351136085259043184`10., \n   -4.4092200974397651158`10.}}}\n{\"Delta_c\", 6, 2, {ScientificForm[7.8619474246792589026`3.], ScientificForm[1301.6538246227582392162`3.], \n  {5520.1162752354157089618`10., -14802.5584646980217986731`10., 16692.7450154410445717336`10., -9983.9574696560472711473`10., \n   3324.7965438643034936507`10., -587.05988847104195178`10., 43.6075622318304711849`10., -23.9061170216573505943`10., 21.0611784426541704455`10., \n   -4.6898964401883666365`10.}}}\n{\"Delta_c\", 6, 3, {ScientificForm[1.5987630343325854749`3.], ScientificForm[1184.6603463697154327504`3.], \n  {5796.4679322023636927648`10., -15693.1087857181435448026`10., 17226.987412841405228797`10., -9933.5474233492947207258`10., \n   3225.1702644489645307572`10., -569.4230080812828913171`10., 43.6075622318304711849`10., 45.1817972200796453564`10., -63.4005733289022741854`10., \n   29.0351136085259043184`10., -4.4092200974397651158`10.}}}\n```",
