  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"[4,3,1] kslope_c D^m = P + Q tau_c: m, deg P, deg Q\", \"max resid fit set / held-out\"}\n{\"{0, 3, 1}\", \"          5           5\\n{3.99 × 10 , 2.05 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{0, 3, 2}\", \"          5           5\\n{3.91 × 10 , 2.50 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{0, 3, 3}\", \"          5           5\\n{3.87 × 10 , 3.58 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{0, 4, 1}\", \"          5           5\\n{3.91 × 10 , 5.74 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{0, 4, 2}\", \"          5           5\\n{3.83 × 10 , 6.33 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{0, 4, 3}\", \"          5           5\\n{3.82 × 10 , 7.63 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{1, 5, 2}\", \"          4           5\\n{1.33 × 10 , 2.15 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{1, 5, 3}\", \"          4           5\\n{1.33 × 10 , 2.17 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{1, 5, 4}\", \"          4           5\\n{1.28 × 10 , 2.46 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{1, 6, 2}\", \"          4           5\\n{1.32 × 10 , 6.17 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{1, 6, 3}\", \"          4           5\\n{1.32 × 10 , 6.20 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{1, 6, 4}\", \"          4           5\\n{1.26 × 10 , 6.63 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{2, 7, 3}\", \"                2\\n{4.89, 2.76 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{2, 7, 4}\", \"          -1           1\\n{1.49 × 10  , 2.40 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{2, 7, 5}\", \"          -3\\n{1.13 × 10  , 1.20}\"}\n{\"{2, 8, 3}\", \"                2\\n{4.89, 2.76 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{2, 8, 4}\", \"          -1           1\\n{1.49 × 10  , 2.40 × 10 }\"}\n{\"{2, 8, 5}\", \"          -3\\n{1.13 × 10  , 1.20}\"}\n{\"fits\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}\n{\"[4,2,2] kslope = kappa_0 x rem slope\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 2}\", \"held-out max rel err        -11\\n1.47 10\", \n \"num coeffs {7.33037037037, -9.95555555556, 4.31407407408, -0.622222222222}\", \"den coeffs {5.44444444444, -4.66666666667, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,2,2] kappa_1 slope check: rem slope\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {3, 2}\", \"held-out max rel err        -11\\n1.37 10\", \n \"num coeffs {9.99595959596, -13.5757575758, 5.88282828283, -0.848484848485}\", \"den coeffs {6.57575757576, -5.15151515152, 1.00000000000}\"}\n{\"[4,3,1] kslope_a + kslope_b\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{3, 2, 1.1924311503685952288`3., 0.0127817773720351907`3.}, \n  {3, 4, 0.0071920521333163378`3., 0.0147886774785355969`3.}, {4, 3, 0.0062844133320161814`3., 0.0169979200634672119`3.}}}\n{\"[4,3,1] kslope_a kslope_b\", \"NO FIT up to degree 4\", {{4, 4, 7.974547548246`3.*^-7, 0.0035022140854805532`3.}, \n  {4, 3, 0.0000682311062719864`3., 0.0212712892429785671`3.}, {4, 2, 0.0011490591727279658`3., 0.0484990162719814164`3.}}}\n{\"[4,3,1] g slope (F1/F0 slope) copy a\", \"(deg num, deg den) = {4, 3}\", \"held-out max rel err        -9\\n8.09 10\", \n \"num coeffs {-0.0281343994011, 0.365646401649, 0.0947173075228, 2.96661096083, -1.43924722266}\", \n \"den coeffs {-0.0695101157047, -0.0212832294935, -0.438906770782, 1.00000000000}\"}\n```",
