   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task B, [4,3,1]: pointwise affine decomposition kslope_c = alpha(t) + beta(t) tau_c (two copies => always solvable pointwise; the content is that alpha, beta are rational in t with denominator D^m), then polynomial fits of alpha D^m, beta D^m. The same for the remainder slope Delta_c = kslope_c/kappa_c is NOT attempted (kappa_c is itself affine in tau_c). *)\nbetaK = (ks431[[All, 1]] - ks431[[All, 2]])/(tau431s[[All, 1]] - tau431s[[All, 2]]); alphaK = ks431[[All, 1]] - betaK tau431s[[All, 1]];\ntabAB = Flatten[Table[Table[{nm, m, dP, With[{r = polyLS[If[nm == \"alpha\", Re[alphaK], Re[betaK]], m, dP]}, {ScientificForm[N[r[[1]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[r[[2]], 3]]}]}, {m, 1, 3}, {dP, {6, 7, 8, 9}}], {nm, {\"alpha\", \"beta\"}}], 2];\nbest = Table[Module[{cands = Select[tabAB, #[[1]] == nm &]}, SortBy[cands, N[#[[4, 2]]] &][[1]]], {nm, {\"alpha\", \"beta\"}}];\ncoA = polyLS[Re[alphaK], 2, 8]; coB = polyLS[Re[betaK], 2, 8];\nGrid[Join[{{\"function\", \"m\", \"deg P\", \"{fit rel resid, held-out rel resid}\"}}, Map[{#[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3]], ToString[#[[4]]]} &, tabAB], {{\"best\", ToString[best], \"\", \"\"}, {\"alpha D^2 coefficients (deg 8)\", ToString[N[coA[[3]], 8]], \"\", \"\"}, {\"beta D^2 coefficients (deg 8)\", ToString[N[coB[[3]], 8]], \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Output of the cell above (kernel K1, cell source run via Get; VS Code did not execute this new file):\n\n```\n{\"function\", \"m\", \"deg P\", \"{fit rel resid, held-out rel resid}\"}\n{\"alpha\", 1, 6, \"          -1           1\\n{7.17 × 10  , 7.49 × 10 }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 1, 7, \"          -1           2\\n{6.42 × 10  , 6.09 × 10 }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 1, 8, \"          -1           3\\n{5.27 × 10  , 6.41 × 10 }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 1, 9, \"          -1           3\\n{5.27 × 10  , 8.21 × 10 }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 2, 6, \"          -7           -3\\n{2.52 × 10  , 1.36 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 2, 7, \"          -9           -5\\n{1.60 × 10  , 4.88 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 2, 8, \"          -14           -9\\n{8.85 × 10   , 1.04 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 2, 9, \"          -14           -9\\n{8.83 × 10   , 1.82 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 3, 6, \"          -5           -1\\n{4.38 × 10  , 2.97 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 3, 7, \"          -6           -2\\n{1.43 × 10  , 4.74 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 3, 8, \"          -8           -3\\n{1.35 × 10  , 3.91 × 10  }\"}\n{\"alpha\", 3, 9, \"          -11           -5\\n{4.96 × 10   , 7.42 × 10  }\"}\n{\"beta\", 1, 6, \"          -1           1\\n{7.17 × 10  , 7.48 × 10 }\"}\n{\"beta\", 1, 7, \"          -1           2\\n{6.41 × 10  , 6.08 × 10 }\"}\n{\"beta\", 1, 8, \"          -1           3\\n{5.27 × 10  , 6.40 × 10 }\"}\n{\"beta\", 1, 9, \"          -1           3\\n{5.26 × 10  , 8.21 × 10 }\"}\n{\"beta\", 2, 6, \"          -13           -11\\n{1.52 × 10   , 1.66 × 10   }\"}\n{\"beta\", 2, 7, \"          -13           -10\\n{1.37 × 10   , 1.15 × 10   }\"}\n{\"beta\", 2, 8, \"          -13           -9\\n{1.13 × 10   , 1.33 × 10  }\"}\n{\"beta\", 2, 9, \"          -13           -9\\n{1.13 × 10   , 2.33 × 10  }\"}\n{\"beta\", 3, 6, \"          -6           -2\\n{7.11 × 10  , 4.11 × 10  }\"}\n{\"beta\", 3, 7, \"          -8           -3\\n{3.72 × 10  , 1.05 × 10  }\"}\n{\"beta\", 3, 8, \"          -10           -5\\n{2.79 × 10   , 7.94 × 10  }\"}\n{\"beta\", 3, 9, \"          -16           -12\\n{2.97 × 10   , 6.12 × 10   }\"}\n{\"best\", \"                         -14           -9                           -16           -12\\n{{alpha, 2, 8, {8.85 × 10   , 1.04 × 10  }}, {beta, \\\n3, 9, {2.97 × 10   , 6.12 × 10   }}}\", \"\", \"\"}\n{\"alpha D^2 coefficients (deg 8)\", \"{133.33591, -463.37903, 691.71635, -355.04754, -80.179760, 77.368585, 1.7040691, -5.6296722, 0.11111327}\", \"\", \"\"}\n{\"beta D^2 coefficients (deg 8)\", \"                                                                                                -7               \\\n-8\\n{15.421256, -34.374866, 36.462767, -10.472060, -2.2269357, 1.1435461, -0.027783426, 6.5747180 10  , -3.3324261 10  }\", \"\", \"\"}\n```",
