  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Round 2, Task B result (the eps^2 layer of (1,2,1) = [4,3,1] x 2 and (1,1,2) = [4,2,2]).**\n\n**Bug found and fixed on the way.** `qtkC` (memoized on (phi, eps, om) only) was not purged by `setPoint`: a first t-scan reused the Q numbers of the first t, which made the \"g slope\" t-independent (and a spurious (phi3, om1 = 7/2) discrepancy). Fix: `qtkC` is now purged with literal symbols in `purge[]` (cell c41); the P1 tables below were computed before any scan (fresh cache), the t-scan was redone after the fix. Task A used the non-memoized `qtk` and is unaffected.\n\n**Exact covector (P1 and t-dependence, all exact rationals).** phi_nu/delta^Lambda = eps c1 + eps^2 c2 + ..., c1 = fac1(om,phi) u', u' = (1, xU) on the two GT indices (u' normalized to first component 1; fac1 = c1[0] depends on om, phi), u = (0,1), c2 = a2 u' + b2 u. Convention: **R := (u.C)/(u'.C) = C2/(C1 + xU C2)**, C = [P_HW Psi]_(nu, e1). a2/fac1 and b2/fac1 are exactly **linear in om2** (exact interpolation degree 1 through 10 points, both weights), om1-independent:\n\n| weight | xU(t) | om2-slope of a2/fac1 | om2-slope of b2/fac1 | at P1 (t = 62/35) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| (1,2,1) | -(t+3)/(2(t-3)) | t(2-t)/(t-3) | not fitted (noise-free values e.g. 525/3698 at P1) | xU = 167/86, a-slope = -496/1505, b-slope = 525/3698 |\n| (1,1,2) | -3(t-1)/(2(t-3)) | -19/35 at P1 (t-form not fitted: zero at isolated t) | 3(t-1)/(t-3) | xU = 81/86, a-slope = -19/35, b-slope = -81/43 |\n\n**The Q-number structure at P1** (F = eps^p Qnum^tk/(delta^Lambda fac1), p = 4, 5; 4-eps Richardson with eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6, 8e-6; 10 om2, om1 = 3/4 unless stated). F0 is om-independent (spread 3e-21, 1.3e-21, 4e-21). g = F1/F0 is a straight line in om2 (degree-1 residual <= 4.3e-15; degrees 2-4 do not improve beyond the 1e-15 truncation level); **its slope is om1-independent (om1 = 7/2: identical to 1e-15) and phi-independent (phi', phi3, phi4: identical to <= 5e-16)**, the intercept and F0 depend on phi. g = s1 + rem, s1 = a2/fac1 + (b2/fac1) R; **the R-carrying coefficient is b2/fac1 (om2-slope b-slope above); its signal slope is a-slope + b-slope R.** Table (P1):\n\n| branch | R (phi-independent) | s1 slope | g slope | remainder slope (g - s1) | kappa_0 | kslope = kappa_0 x rem |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [4,3,1] #1 (tau = 9.815) | -0.0932674373 | -0.3428091568 | -1.0162824575 | -0.6734733008 | 1.4105699290 | -0.9499811860 |\n| [4,3,1] #2 (tau = 35.631) | 0.5471061670 | -0.2518961924 | 0.7940852803 | 1.0459814726 | 0.9867134862 | 1.0320840253 |\n| [4,2,2] | -0.4858757062 | 0.3723970944 | -0.1527827012 | -0.5251797956 | 1.3661016949 | -0.71743 |\n\nThe remainder is **structural** (om1-, om2-linear-coefficient, phi-independent) but it is **not a pure constant of the signal type**: kappa_1 := the om2-slope of the O(eps) correction of R_C/S (kslope = kappa_0 x rem) is the object with a clean closed form.\n\n**t-scan (h = 1, theta = (t,0), 20 t, fit on 14, held out 6; corrected scan).**\n- R_c([4,3,1]) = A + B tau_c, A = (-10 + 28t/3 + 4t^2 - 4t^3 + 2t^4/3)/D, B = (-3/2 + t - t^2/6)/D, **D = t^3 + 3t^2 - 17t + 5** (the denominator of the kappa fits of Task A); held-out 1.9e-16 / 5.7e-18; R_a + R_b and R_a R_b rational (3,3) with the same D (8.8e-18, 1.8e-17).\n- [4,2,2]: R = -2(t-3)/(3(3t-7)) (held-out exact to 1e-37 in the fit), **kslope = (-(28/45) t^3 + (2912/675) t^2 - (448/45) t + 4948/675)/(t - 7/3)^2** (held-out 1.5e-11, the coefficients are 1e-9-noise-limited rationals), i.e. rem = kslope/kappa_422 with the pole structure (3t-7)^2 (11t-31)... ; the t = 7/3 point (kappa pole) is excluded.\n- [4,3,1]: kslope_c = alpha(t) + beta(t) tau_c, **beta = (3331 - 7425t + 7876t^2 - 2262t^3 - 481t^4 + 247t^5 - 6t^6)/(216 D^2)** (held-out 1.7e-11 relative), **alpha = P8(t)/D^2** with P8 of degree 8 (leading coefficient ~1/9; held-out 1.0e-9 relative; the coefficients are not rationalizable at the 1e-6 noise level, the numeric polynomial is stored in `caC`). At P1 the closed form reproduces the measured kslope: -0.94998118599 (copy 1) vs measured -0.949981186023.\n- **What did NOT fit:** (i) the remainder slope rem_c itself (= kslope_c/kappa_c) as an affine-in-tau_c form with polynomial/D coefficients (checked up to degrees 6-8, fit-set residual >= 1e-1); one has to divide by kappa_c = A + B tau_c, which is not affine. (ii) the symmetric functions of rem_c are not simple rational functions of low degree; (iii) alpha(t) is only a numerical degree-8 fit, not an identified rational; (iv) the t-form of the (1,2,1) b-slope and of the (1,1,2) a-slope.\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task C. Final pure-Q-side extraction of all 10 HW branches (P1 and the out-of-sample point t = 19/14)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ROUND 2, Task C: pure Q-side extraction of all 10 HW branches at a chain point (h, theta). Inputs from the Q side only: Qnum^tk = Qnum - Tq (Qnum = R_Q/R_Q(top) <v1 v2|e1e1>/<x0|e1e1>, Tq the top-kill det6) for 6 om2 x 4 eps, tau_c = t2(theta1+h)/h^4 = chi3 nu1(theta1+h) nu2(theta1) Q^j(theta1-h)/Q^j(theta1)/h^4 (dual-Q dictionary, eps -> 0 by Richardson), and the closed forms of Tasks A-B: kappa(t [, tau_c]), Delta_c(t, tau_c) for [5,2,1], kslope(t, tau_c) for [4,3,1], kslope(t) for [4,2,2] (fitted forms, noise 1e-9; labeled), exact covector data (fac_k, xU, aSlope, bSlope: analytic functions of the twists, no chain input). The CHAIN side is used only for the comparison columns. *)\nkap440[t_] := (t + 1)/2; kap422[t_] := (11 t - 31)/(5 (3 t - 7)); kap332[t_] := (t + 1) (19 t - 49)/(40 (t - 2));\nA431[t_] := (-7 t^4 + 26 t^3 - 166 t + 75)/(9 D431[t]); B431[t_] := (7 t^2 - 22 t + 23)/(36 D431[t]);\nDlt[t_, tau_] := (111 + 44 t - 92 t^2)/105 + (23 t - 13)/(105 (t + 4)) tau;\ncaC = polyLS[Re[alphaK], 2, 8][[3]];\nbetaNum = {3331, -7425, 7876, -2262, -481, 247, -6}/216;\nkslope431[t_, tau_] := Sum[caC[[i + 1]] t^i, {i, 0, 8}]/D431[t]^2 + Sum[betaNum[[i + 1]] t^i, {i, 0, 6}]/D431[t]^2 tau;\nkslope422[t_] := (-28/45 t^3 + 2912/675 t^2 - 448/45 t + 4948/675)/(t - 7/3)^2;\ntauQof[ib_, B3_] := Table[Re[rich[Table[With[{b = brOf[B3[[ie]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]}, (Times @@ b[\"st\"][\"z\"]) auditNu[hN, thN, 1, th1 + hN] auditNu[hN, thN, 2, th1] QUf[b[\"st\"], j, th1 - hN]/QUf[b[\"st\"], j, th1]], {ie, 3}]][[3]]]/hN^4, {j, 3}];\n(* branch table: {ib, weight, k (leading eps order), pB, dim} *)\ntcSpec = {{1, {3, 1, 0}, 0, 2}, {2, {3, 0, 1}, 0, 3}, {3, {2, 2, 0}, 0, 3}, {4, {2, 1, 1}, 0, 4}, {5, {2, 1, 1}, 0, 4}, {6, {1, 3, 0}, 1, 4}, {7, {1, 2, 1}, 1, 5}, {8, {1, 2, 1}, 1, 5}, {9, {1, 1, 2}, 1, 6}, {10, {0, 2, 2}, 2, 7}};\nfacAt[ib_, o_, xU_] := Module[{wt = tcSpec[[ib, 2]], k = tcSpec[[ib, 3]]},\n  Which[ib == 1, 1, ib == 2, c0G[phiP, o], ib == 3, a0G[phiP, o], ib == 4 || ib == 5, fac0Of[phiP, o], True, covC[phiP, o, wt][[Min[k, 2]]][[1]]]];\ntcSetup[hh_, ths_] := (setPoint[hh, ths]; tC = th12/hN; om6x = Table[{3/4, o2}, {o2, om2s}];\n  B4 = Table[branchesAt[reg[epsL4[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], {ie, 4}];\n  xU = (covC[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {1, 2, 1}][[1]])[[2]]/(covC[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {1, 2, 1}][[1]])[[1]];\n  xU422 = (covC[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {1, 1, 2}][[1]])[[2]]/(covC[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {1, 1, 2}][[1]])[[1]];\n  tauQs = Association[Table[ib -> tauQof[ib, B4], {ib, {4, 5, 7, 8}}]]);\ntauQ[ib_] := tauQs[ib][[1]];\nkapPred[ib_] := Switch[ib, 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5, 1, 6, kap440[tC], 7 | 8, A431[tC] + B431[tC] tauQ[ib], 9, kap422[tC], 10, kap332[tC]];\nchainSl[ib_, ie_] := With[{b = brOf[B4[[ie]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]], ix = idxOf[tcSpec[[ib, 2]]]}, PHWc[hwList[[ib, 1]]][b[\"psi\"]][[(ix - 1) d1 + 1]]];\nuF[ib_] := Which[ib == 4 || ib == 5, {2, 8}, ib == 7 || ib == 8, {1, xU}, ib == 9, {1, xU422}, True, {1}];\nuSec[ib_] := Which[ib == 4 || ib == 5, {-1, 8}, ib == 7 || ib == 8, {0, 1}, ib == 9, {0, 1}, True, {}];\nchainFirst[ib_, ie_] := uF[ib] . chainSl[ib, ie];\ncqF[ib_, ie_, io_] := With[{R = reg[epsL4[[ie]], phiP, om6x[[io, 1]], om6x[[io, 2]]], d = qtkC[phiP, epsL4[[ie]], om6x[[io]]]}, With[{num = If[ib == 1, d[\"qn\"][[1]], d[\"qn\"][[ib]] - d[\"Tq\"][[ib]]]}, num/(deltaL[R] epsL4[[ie]]^tcSpec[[ib, 3]] facAt[ib, om6x[[io]], 0] kapPred[ib])]];\ntcBranch[ib_] := Module[{pB = tcSpec[[ib, 4]], err1, richQ, richC, fq, fc, Rq, Rc, exa, exb, remS, Fv, g, sl, row, M, CQ, CC, ad, k0},\n  err1 = Max[Table[Abs[cqF[ib, 1, io]/chainFirst[ib, 1] - 1], {io, 6}]];\n  fq = Table[cqF[ib, ie, 1] epsL4[[ie]]^pB, {ie, 3}]; fc = Table[chainFirst[ib, ie] epsL4[[ie]]^pB, {ie, 3}];\n  richQ = rich[fq][[3]]; richC = rich[fc][[3]];\n  row = <|\"ib\" -> ib, \"err1\" -> err1, \"richAgree\" -> Abs[richQ/richC - 1], \"limC\" -> Re[richC], \"limQ\" -> Re[richQ], \"tauQ\" -> If[KeyExistsQ[tauQs, ib], tauQs[ib][[1]], None]|>;\n  If[Length[uSec[ib]] == 2,\n    Fv = Table[vandInv4 . Table[cqF[ib, ie, io] epsL4[[ie]]^pB kapPred[ib], {ie, 4}], {io, 6}];\n    g = Fv[[All, 2]]/Fv[[All, 1]]; sl = polyFit[om2s, Re[g], 1][[1, 2]];\n    If[ib == 4 || ib == 5,\n      Rq = Re[(sl - (tC - 5)/4 - Dlt[tC, tauQ[ib]])/((7 - 3 tC)/2)],\n      ad = Table[covDecomp[phiP, o, tcSpec[[ib, 2]], If[ib == 9, xU422, xU]], {o, om6x}]; k0 = kapPred[ib];\n      exa = polyFit[om2s, Re[ad[[All, 2]]/ad[[All, 1]]], 1][[1, 2]]; exb = polyFit[om2s, Re[ad[[All, 3]]/ad[[All, 1]]], 1][[1, 2]];\n      remS = If[ib == 9, kslope422[tC], kslope431[tC, tauQ[ib]]]/k0;\n      Rq = Re[(sl - exa - remS)/exb]];\n    Rc = Re[(vandInv4 . Table[With[{Cv = chainSl[ib, ie]}, (uSec[ib] . Cv)/(uF[ib] . Cv)], {ie, 4}])[[1]]];\n    M = {uSec[ib], uF[ib]}; CQ = LinearSolve[M, {Rq Re[richQ], Re[richQ]}]; CC = rich[Table[chainSl[ib, ie] epsL4[[ie]]^pB, {ie, 3}]][[3]];\n    row = Join[row, <|\"R_Q\" -> Rq, \"R_chain\" -> Rc, \"dR\" -> Abs[Rq - Rc], \"sliceErr\" -> Re[Max[Abs[(CQ - Re[CC])/Re[CC]]]], \"gSlope\" -> sl|>]];\n  row];\ntaskC[hh_, ths_] := (tcSetup[hh, ths]; <|\"t\" -> tC, \"res\" -> Table[tcBranch[r[[1]]], {r, tcSpec}], \"tauQ\" -> tauQs, \"xU\" -> {xU, xU422}|>);\nfmtS[x_] := If[x == 0, \"0\", ToString[NumberForm[N[Re[x]], 3, ExponentFunction -> (# &)]]];\nshowTC[tc_] := Grid[Join[{{\"branch\", \"extracted\", \"err at eps=1e-6 (max over 6 om)\", \"|Q/chain - 1| Richardson (om A)\", \"limit chain (first direction)\", \"tau_Q\", \"R_Q\", \"R_chain\", \"|dR|\", \"full-slice limit err (max comp)\"}}, Table[{ToString[hwList[[r[\"ib\"]]]], If[KeyExistsQ[r, \"R_Q\"], \"full slice (first dir + R)\", \"full slice (1 comp)\"], fmtS[r[\"err1\"]], fmtS[r[\"richAgree\"]], ToString[N[r[\"limC\"], 12]], If[r[\"tauQ\"] === None, \"-\", ToString[N[r[\"tauQ\"], 10]]], If[KeyExistsQ[r, \"R_Q\"], ToString[N[r[\"R_Q\"], 12]], \"-\"], If[KeyExistsQ[r, \"R_chain\"], ToString[N[r[\"R_chain\"], 12]], \"-\"], If[KeyExistsQ[r, \"dR\"], fmtS[r[\"dR\"]], \"-\"], If[KeyExistsQ[r, \"sliceErr\"], fmtS[r[\"sliceErr\"]], \"-\"]}, {r, tc[\"res\"]}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
