  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task C drivers: *)\n{tTC1, tc1} = AbsoluteTiming[taskC[1/2, {2/7, -3/5}]]; showTC[tc1]\n(* P3 (out of sample): {tTC3, tc3} = AbsoluteTiming[taskC[1/2, {3/7, -1/4}]]; showTC[tc3]; setPoint[1/2, {2/7, -3/5}]; *)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
